<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Johan</book>
  <para style="h">Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hramthokah Thu a rak um. Cuih Thu cu Pathian thawn a um ih Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hramthok ihsin cuih Thu cu Pathian thawn a um zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah sung ihsin Pathian in ziang hmuahhmuah a seemsuah; seemsuah mi thil hmuahhmuah sungah hin amah tel loih tuahmi pakhatte hman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih Thu cu nunnak ih hram a si ih cuih nunnak cun minung hnenah tleunak a run thlen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tleunak cu khawthim sungah a tleu ih thimnak in a hmit thei dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in a palai Johan a thlah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Johan cu mi hnenah cuih tleunak thu sim dingin a ra. A simmi hmuahhmuah in an theih ih an zumnak dingah a ra a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih cu tleunak a si lo; tleunak thu sim dingah a rami a si sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih tleunak cu tleunak taktak a si. Cuih tleunak cu leitlun ah a ra ih mi hmuahhmuah tlettu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih Thu cu leitlun ah hin a um ih amah sung ihsin Pathian in leilung hi a tuah naón leilung in amah cu a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ram sungah a ra naón a minung pawl in an rak saang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat cun an saang ih an zum; curuangah Pathian ih faate cantheinak thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian ih faate an cannak cu leilung daan, minung ih thi le sa in hrinmi in a si lo; Pathian amah rori kha an Pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih Thu cu minung ah a cang ih kan lakah a um; zaangfahnak le thutak in a khat. A sunlawinak kan hmu ih a Pa in a fapa neihsun hnenih a pekmi sunlawinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Johan in cupa ih thu cu hiti in a sim: “‘Amah cu ka hnuah a ra; asinain kei hnakin a tum sawn, ziangahtile amah cu ka suah hlanah a rak um zo,’ tiih ka lo simmi kha amah ih thu hi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A famkim zetmi a zaangfahnak thawn kannih cu in thlawsuah zo ih a thlawsuah cu pakhat hnu pakhat in pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian ih Daan cu Moses hnen ihsin in pek; asinain zaangfahnak le thutak cu Jesuh Khrih sung ihsin a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zohman in Pathian cu an hmu dah lo. A Pa ih Fapa neihsun, a ṭaang sungih a pommi, Pathian a si mi in a langter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem ih Judah hotu pawl in puithiam ṭhenkhat pawl le Levi mi pawl kha Johan hnenah cun an thlah ih, “Nang hi zoso na si?” tiah an va sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Johan cun an thusuhmi cu pheh lotein a let ih, “Kei hi Messiah ka si lo,” tiah fiangtein zapi theih ah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Annih in, “Asile zoso na si? Elijah na si maw?” tiah an sut. Johan in, “Ka si lo,” a ti. Annih in, “Profet na si maw?” an ti lala. “Ka si lo,” a ti thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Annih in, “Cuti asile zoso na si, in simhnik. Na thu lehmi cu in thlahtu hnenah kan va sim sal a ṭul. Zo ka si, tiin so na ti awk?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Johan in Profet Isaiah ih simmi kha a vun lak ih, “Kei cu ‘Bawipa ih fehnak lamzin kha dingter uh,’ tiih ramṭhingih a au-mi aw kha ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Farasi pawl ih an thlahmi palai pawl cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Johan cu thu an sut sal ih, “Messiah na si lo ih Elijah le Profet khal na si lo ahcun ziangah so baptisma na pek?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Johan in, “Kei cun tidai in baptisma ka pek, asinain nan lakah nan theih hrih lomi mi pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amah cu ka dungah a ra lai; sikhalsehla kei cu a kedam hri phoihtu hmanah ka tlak lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hitiih an suh awknak hmun cu Johan in baptisma a peknak Jordan tiva ihsin nisuah lamih a ummi Bethani khua ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A thaisun ah Johan in Jesuh a hnenih a rat lai kha a hmu ih, “Leilung sualnak a phurtu Pathian Tuufa khi zohhnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Ka dungin mi pakhat a ra, asinain kei hnakin a tum sawn, ziangahtile ka suah hlanah anih cu a rak um zo,’ tiih a thuhla ka sim rero zo mipa cu amah hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amah hi zo a si ding ti ka rak thei lo. Asinain amah hi Israel mi pawl ih an theihnak dingah tidai in baptisma ka pek rero sannak a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Johan in, “Thlarau cu vancung ihsin thuro bangin a rung ih a parah a rung fut kha ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amah teu a si tihi ka rak thei thotho cuang lo, sikhalsehla tidai in baptisma pe dingih i thlahtu Pathian in ‘Thlarau a rung ding ih mi pakhat parih a fut kha na hmu ding; cupa cu Thlarau Thianghlim in baptisma petu ding a si,’ tiah i sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cupa cu ka hmu ngah zo. Fiangtein ka lo sim: Amah cu Pathian Fapa a si,” tiah a hmuhmi le a theihmi kha a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A thaisun ah Johan le a dungthluntu pahnih cu cutawk ah an ding sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesuh a rat kha an hmuh tikah, “Pathian Tuufa khi zohhnik uh,” tiah Johan in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cutiih a timi cu a dungthluntu pahnih cun an thei ih Jesuh hnenah cun an feh ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh cu a dunglet a her ih an rak thlun kha a hmuh tikah, “Ziang so nan hawl?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Rabbi, khui-ah so na um?” tiah an let. Rabbi ticu zirhtu Sayapa tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ra uhla ra zohhnik uh,” tiah a ti. Cuih tikcu cu zanlam nazi pali hrawng a si. An feh ih a umnak cu an va hmu ih cuih ni cu a hnenah an caam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cuih mi pahnih lakah pakhat cu Simon Piter ih naupa Andru a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hmakhatteah a u-pa Simon kha a va hawl ih a hmuh tikah, “Messiah cu kan hmu zo,” tiah a ti. Messiah timi cu Khrih tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cule Simon cu Jesuh hnenah a fehpi. Jesuh in amah cu a zoh ih, “Na hmin cu Johan fapa Simon a si; sikhalsehla Sefas tiah kawh na si thlang ding,” a ti. Sefas ticu Piter ti thawn a bang aw ih a tican cu ‘lungto,’ tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A thaisun ah Jesuh cu Galilee feh a tum. Filip kha a hmu ih a hnenah, “I thlun aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Filip cu Andru le Piter umnak Bethsaida khua mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Filip in Nathanael a tong ih a hnenah, “Moses in Daan cabu sungah a thuhla a nganmi le profet pawl khal in a thuhla an ngan mipa kha kan tong zo. Amah cu Josef fapa Jesuh, Nazareth khuami a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nathanael in, “Nazareth khua in thil ṭha a suak thei pei maw?” tiah a ti. Filip in, “Ra zohhnik awla!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesuh in Nathanael a rat kha a hmuh tikah, “Israel mi taktak hi zohhnik uh! A thinlung ah zianghman hrawhhrawlnak a um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nathanael in, “Ziangtin so i theih?” tiah a sut. Jesuh in, “Filip ih a lo kawh hlan theipi kung hnuai ih na to lai ah khan ka lo hmu zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nathanael in, “Sayapa, nang cu Pathian Fapa na si! Israel Siangpahrang na si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Theipi kung hnuai ih na to lai ka lo hmu, ka ti ruangah i zum a si maw? Hi hnakih thil maksak tampi na hmu lai ding!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Cule an hnenah, “Thungai in ka lo sim: vancung khi a ong aw ding ih Milai Fapa parah hin Pathian ih vancungmi an ṭum le an kai kha nan hmu ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni hnih hnuah Galilee peng Kana khua ah nupi ṭhit puai a um. Jesuh ih nu khal cunah a um ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl kha an sawm ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An sabitti a cem tikah a nu in Jesuh hnenah, “Sabitti an nei nawn lo,” tiah a ra sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh in, “Ka nu, i sim duh hlah; ka tikcu a kim hrih lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nu cun hnen-um pawl hnenah, “A lo simmi poh tuah uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutawkah Judah daanih a um vekin an kut kholhnak hrangah tidai ralca beel tumpi beel ruk an ret. Beel khat in galan kul ihsin sawmthum tiang a dawl thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesuh in hnen-um pawl hnenah cun, “Hi beel pawl hi tidai khat tein than uh,” a ti. Liam thluahthlo in an than ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />an hnenah cun, “Beel sung tidai cu vun suak uhla puaituahnak a tawlreltu pa hnenah hei pek uh,” tiah a ti. Tidai cu an hei pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih tidai cu sabitti ah a cang ih cumi cu a tep. Khuitawkin cuih sabitti cu a ra ti a thei lo; tidai a suaktu hnen-um pawl cun an thei ko. Curuangah nupi ṭhitu pa cu a ko ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a hnenah cun, “Zozo khal in sabitti thaw bik kha a hmaisabik ah an pe ṭheu ih mi tampi an khawh deuh hnuah sabitti menmen kha an pe ṭheu; asinain nang cun sabitti thaw bik kha a netnak tiang na pe thei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh in hi mangbangza hmaisa bik hi Galilee peng Kana khua ah a tuah. Cuticun a sunlawinak a langter ih a dungthluntu pawl in an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh le a nu, a naule pawl le a dungthluntu pawl cu Kapernaum khua ah an feh ih cutawkah ni malte sung an cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lantak Puai tikcu a kim zik thlang ih Jesuh cu Jerusalem ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biakinn a thlen tikah cutawkih caw le tuu le laileng pawl a zuartu le tangka a thlengtu pawl an cabuai ih an to kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah hri kha vuaknak fung ai-ah a merh ih, tuu siseh caw siseh an zuarmi pawl cu a vuak ih Biakinn sung ihsin a dawi ṭheh; tangka thlengtu pawl ih cabuai pawl khal a linglet ṭheh ih an tangkanawi pawl a thehdarh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laileng a zuartu pawl cu, “Hitawk ihsin nan laileng pawl kha tlanpi ṭheh uh! Ka Pa ih inn cu nan dawr tuahnak ah hmang nawn hlah uh!” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah a dungthluntu pawl in, “Maw Pathian, na inn ka tlaihsannak cu ka lung sungah meisa bangin a alh,” tiah Ca Thianghlim ih a rak timi kha an vun mang sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah mi hotu pawl cu an ra sal ih, “Hi bangtuk thil tuah theinak thu ka nei, ti na langternak ah ziang hmuhsaknak so in hmuh ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Hi Biakinn hi bal uhla ni thum sungah ka sak sal thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Annih in, “Ni thum sungah na sak sal thei ngai pei maw? Hi Biakinn saknak ah hin kum sawm li le kum ruk a rei a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh ih a sim duhmi Biakinn cu amah ih taksa ruangpi kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh thihnak ihsin a thawhsal tikah a dungthluntu pawl in amah ih taksa ruangpi thu a sim ti kha an thei sal ih Ca Thianghlim simmi le Jesuh simmi kha an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh cu Lantak Puai sung Jerusalem khawsungih a um laiah mi tampi in mangbangza a tuahmi an hmuh ruangah amah kha an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh cun a thinlung zatein a zum hai lo, ziangahtile minung cu ziangvek an si ti kha a thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An thuhla cu midang ih sim a ṭul lo, ziangahtile an thinlung ziangvek a si ti cu amah in a thei ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah mi hotu pa pakhat, a hminah Nikodemas an timi a rak um; amah cu Farasi mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zan khat cu Jesuh hnenah a va feh ih Jesuh cu, “Rabbi, nang cu Pathian ih run thlahmi saya na si, ti kan lo thei. Mangbangza na tuahmi pawl hi Pathian tel lo cun zohman in an tuah thei lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: zokhal hrin sal a si lo ahcun Pathian Uknak a hmu thei lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nikodemas in, “Ziangtin so patling cia cu hrin sal a si thei ding? A nuih pum sungah lut tahratin voihnih hrin sal cu a si thei hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: zokhal tidai le Thlarau in hrin sal a si lo ahcun Pathian Uknak sungah a lut thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minung cu taksa lam cun a nu le a pa sung ihsin hrinmi a si; sikhalsehla thlarau lamah cun Thlarau ih hrinmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hrin salmi na si a ṭul ka ti tikah na mangbang hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thli cu a duhnak poh ah a hrang; a thawm na thei, asinain khuitawk ihsin a ra ih khuilamah a feh ding ti na thei lo. Thlarau ih hrinmi khal cu cubangtuk in an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nikodemas cun, “Ziangtin so cumi cu a si thei ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nang cu Israel mi lakah zirhtu saya pakhat na si ih himi hman na thei thei lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: kannih cu kan theihmi kan sim ih kan hmuhmi kha kan than; asinain zokhal in kan thu simmi nan pom duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi leitlun thuhla ka lo sim ih i zum lo; cuti asile ziangtinso vancung thuhla ka lo sim tikah na zum thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vancung ihsin a rung ṭummi Milai Fapa siarlo zohman vancungah a kaitu an um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Moses in nelrawn ah fung parih dar rul a thlai bangtuk in Milai Fapa khal thlai a si ve ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />cuti cun amah a zumtu hmuahhmuah cu kumkhua nunnak an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian in leilung hi a duhdawt zet ruangah a Fapa neihsun a pek ih amah a zumtu hmuahhmuah cu thi loin kumkhua nunnak an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ziangahtile leilung tlunah Pathian in a Fapa a run thlah tikah leilung thuṭhentu dingah a thlah lo, leilung runtu dingah a thlah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zokhal Fapa a zumtu cu thuṭhennak a tong lo ding; sikhalsehla a zum lotu cu Pathian ih Fapa neihsun a zum lo ruangah thuṭhennak a tong zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuṭhennak timi cu hiti in a si: leilung tlunah hin tleunak a ra thleng, asinain mi in tleunak hnakin thimnak an duh sawn; ziangahtile an tuahnak a ṭhat lo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zokhal thil ṭha lo a tuahtu cun tleunak a hua ih tleunak sung khal ah a ra lo ding, ziangahtile a thil ṭha lo tuahmi kha a lang pang ding ti a phang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a dikmi a tuahtu cu tleunak sungah a ra ih a tuahmi cu Pathian duhmi thlunin a tuah a si ti kha cuih tleunak cun a langter,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu a dungthluntu pawl thawn Judea peng ah an feh ih an hnenah malte sung a um ih baptisma tla a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Johan khal Aenon timi, Salim ihsin a hlat lonak hmun ah, baptisma a pek ve, ziangahtile cutawkah cun tidai tampi a um. Mi tampi a hnenah an ra ih baptisma a pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himi cu Johan thawng an thlak hlanih a cangmi thil a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Johan dungthluntu ṭhenkhat pawl le Judah mipa pakhat cu thianfaiter awknak thu ah thu an el aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Curuangah Johan hnenah an feh ih, “Sayapa, Jordan tiva ihsin nisuah lamih nangmah thawn a rak um dah pa kha na ciing lai a si lo maw? A thu na rel ṭheu mi kha! Atu-ah baptisma a pek rero ve ih mi tampi a hnenah an feh a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Johan in, “Pathian pekmi ti lo cun zohman in zianghman comi an nei thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keimah rori in, ‘Kei cu Messiah ka si lo; a hlanih a rak thleng sungmi ka si,’ tiah ka simmi theitu cu nanmah nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ṭhitmi mothar cu a ṭhitu tlangval pa ih ta a si; asinain nupi ṭhitu tlangval pa ih rualpi, a ding ih aw thawm a ngaitu pa cu, tlangval pa ih aw a theih tikah cun a lung a awi ngaingai. Cuih lungawinak cu ka ta a si ih ka lungawinak cu a famkim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah cu a ṭhangso ding ih kei cu ka ṭumsuk ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tlunlam ihsin a rungmi cu mi hmuahhmuah hnakin a tum sawn. Leilung ih a ummi cu leilung ta a si ih leilung tlun thuhla a sim; asinain vancung ihsin a rami cu ziang hmuahhmuah tlunah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah cun a hmuhmi le a theihmi thuhla pawl a sim naón zohman in a thu cu an pom lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sikhalsehla zokhal a thu simmi a pomtu cu cutiih a pomnak in Pathian cu a dik a si, ti kha a hngetter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian ih a thlahmi cun Pathian ih thu a phuang, ziangahtile Pathian in a Thlarau famkim in a hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A pa in a Fapa cu a duhdawt ih ziang hmuahhmuah a kut sungah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Fapa a zumtu cun kumkhua nunnak a nei; Fapa-ih thu a eltu cun nunnak a nei lo ding ih Pathian ih thinhengnak a tuar ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh cu Johan hnakin dungthluntu tam deuh a nei ih baptisma tla tam deuh a pek, tiah Farasi mi pawl in an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ngaingai ahcun Jesuh amah cun zohman baptisma a pek lo; a dungthluntu lawng in an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutiih an rel ruri mi cu Jesuh in a theih tikah Judah ram ihsin a suak ih Galilee ah a kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kir phahah Samaria ram a pal phah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria ramih a feh laiah Saikhar an timi khua pakhat a thleng. Cuih Saikhar khua cu Jakob in a fapa Josef hnenih a pekmi loram ihsin a hlat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutawkah cun Jakob tikhur a um. Jesuh cu a khual tlawnnak ah a bang zet ih cuih tikhur kiangah cun a to. A tikcu cu sun hrawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samaria nunau nu pakhat cu tidai khai dingah a ra ih Jesuh in a hnenah, “Tidai in ding i pe aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dungthluntu pawl cu rawl lei dingah khawsung ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih nunau nu cun, “Nang cu Judah mi na si ih kei cu Samaria mi ka si; ziangtinso tidai in ding i dil?” tiah a ti. Judah mi pawl cun Samaria mi pawl ih hmanmi khokheng pawl an hmang duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Pathian ih a lo pekmi laksawng hi ziang a si, ti le tidai a lo diltu hi zo a si, ti thei cila amah sawn na dil ding ih anih in nunnak tidai a lo pe ding naón!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih nunau nu in, “Bawipa, balṭin na nei lo ih tikhur hi a thuk zet fawn. Khuitawk in so cuih nunnak tidai cu na lak ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan pu Jakob in hi tikhur hi in pek; amah le a fapa pawl siseh, a tuu rual le a caw rual pawl siseh, hi tikhur ihsin tidai an ngah. Jakob hnakin ka tum sawn tiah na ruat aw maw si?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zokhal siseh hi tidai a intu cu a ti a haal sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka pek dingmi tidai a intu cu a ti a haal nawn lo ding. Ka pek dingmi tidai cu amah sungah cirhti ah a cang ding ih cumi cun nunnak tidai le kumkhua nunnak a pe ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunau nu in, “Bawipa, cuih tidai cu i pe aw! Cuticun ka ti a haal nawn lo ding ih hitawk ah tidai khai ding khalah ka rat a ṭul nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Na pasal va ko awla ra sal aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih in, “Pasal ka nei lo,” tiah a let. Jesuh in, “Pasal ka nei lo na ti cu thudik na sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasal panga na nei zo ih atu na umpi mi pa hi na pasal ngaingai a si lo. Thudik i sim a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nunau nu in, “Bawipa, profet na si ti ka lo thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kannih Samaria mi kan pupa pawl cun hi tlang parah hin Pathian an rak biak; sikhalsehla nannih Judah mi cun Pathian cu Jerusalem ah biak ding a si, nan ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh cun a hnenah, “Nunau nu, ka lo simmi hi zum aw: Mi in Pathian cu hi tlang ah siseh, Jerusalem khal ah siseh, an biak lo can a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nannih Samaria mi cun nan biakmi nan thei ngaingai lo; asinain kannih Judah mi cun kan biakmi kan thei, ziangahtile rundamnak cu Judah mi hnen ihsin a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian Thlarau hruainak thawngin Pathian a bia taktaktu in Pa cu thlarau le thutak thawn an biak caan a ra thleng ding; a si, cuih caan cu atu-ah a ra thleng zo. Cutiih biak cu Pathian in a duhmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian cu Thlarau a si ih a biatu pawl in thlarau le thutak in an bia ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nunau nu in a hnenah, “Messiah cu a ra ding ih a rat tikah cun ziang hmuahhmuah amah in in sim leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Na hnenih a ṭong rerotu hi amah cu ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Culai fangah Jesuh dungthluntu pawl cu an ra kir ih nunau nu thawn an biak awk rero kha an hmuh tikah an mang a bang ngaingai. Sikhalsehla zohman in cu nu cu, “Ziang so na duh?” tiah an sut lo. Jesuh khal cu, “Ziangah so hi nu cu na biak?” tiah an sut ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cule nunau nu cu a tithawl a tanta ih khawsungih a vung feh hnuah mi senpi hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hlanih thil ka tuah ciami hmuahhmuah i sim theitu pa hi ra zohhnik uh! Amah hi Messiah cu a si pei maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuticun khawsung in an suak ih Jesuh hnenah cun an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Culai ah dungthluntu pawl in Jesuh cu, “Sayapa, rawl ei aw,” tiah an fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anih in, “Nan theih lomi rawl ei ding ka nei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl cun, “Pakhatkhat in rawl an rak pek a si pei maw?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an sut aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Kei ka rawl cu i thlahtu-ih duhnak tuah le hnaṭuan i fialmi ṭuan ṭheh hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ṭongṭhimnak ah ‘Thla li hnuah rawl khawm caan,’ tiah nan ti. Sikhalsehla thungai in ka lo sim: lo sung khi hei zohhnik uh! Lorawl an thar zo ih rawl lak caan a cu zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Rawl a latu pa cu a hlawhman kha pek a si ih rawl cu kumkhua a nunnak hrangah a khawm. Cuticun thlaici a tuhtu le rawl a latu cu hmun khatah an lung a awi tlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ziangahtile ṭongṭhimnak ih ‘Mi pakhat in a tuh; a dang pakhat in a at,’ timi cu a dikzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nan rak ṭuan dah lonak lo sungah fang at dingin ka lo thlah hai. Cutawkah midang ih an rak ṭuan cianak ihsin midang hnaṭuan ruangah a miat nan ngah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nunau nu in, “Ka rak tuah ciami hmuahhmuah i sim sal ṭheh,” tiah a ti hrangah cuih khawsungih a ummi Samaria mi tampi in Jesuh cu an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A hnenah Samaria mi pawl an ra ih, “Kan hnenah cam hrih aw,” tiah an ra sawm ih ni hnih a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh thusimmi an thei ih mi tam sinsin in an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cule nunau nu hnenah cun, “Atu cu nangmah ih thusimmi ruangah si loin kanmah rori in a thu simmi kan thei ih kan zum; amah hi leilung Runtu a si taktak ti khal kan thei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutawkah ni hnih a cam hnuah Jesuh cu a suak ih Galilee ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ziangahtile amah rori in, “Profet cu amah ih ramah cun upatnak a ngah lo,” tiah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Galilee-ih a thlen tikah cutawkih mipi pawl in an rak hmuak, ziangahtile Jerusalem khua Lantak Puai ah a feh ih cuih puai sungih a thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah an rak hmuh zo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu tidai kha sabitti ih a rak canternak Galilee peng Kana khua ah a feh sal. Cutawkah acozah bawi pakhat a rak um ih a fapa pakhat Kapernaum khua ah a na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesuh cu Judea ihsin Galilee a ra thleng ti a theih tikah a hnenah cun a va feh ih, Kapernaum khua ah va feh in a thizikmi a fapa damter dingah zaangfah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Hmuhsaknak le khawruahhar thil tla nan hmuh dah ti lo ahcun zohman in nannih pawl cun nan zum lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Cuih acozah bawipa cun, “Bawipa, ka fapa a thih hlanah ra hram aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesuh in a hnenah cun, “Va tlung aw, na fapa cu a nung ding,” tiah a ti. Cupa in Jesuh ih ṭong cu a zum ih a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A tlunnak lamzin ihsin a hnen-um pawl in an rak hmuak ih, “Na fapa cu a nung ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Anih in, “Ziangtik caanah so ka fapa cu a dam deuh?” tiah a sut tikah annih in, “Mizan sun zanlam nazi pakhat ah a khurhnat a reh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Cuih caan cu Jesuh in ‘Na fapa a nung ding,’ tiih a rak ti caante kha a si, tiah a pa cun a hun thei sal. Cuticun amah le a innsang zatein an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Himi hi Jesuh cu Judea ihsin Galilee-ih a rat hnuah a voihnihnak mangbangza a tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu Jerusalem ah Judah biaknak puai pakhat a um ih a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ahcun Tuu Kotka an timi kiangah tili pakhat a um ih a kapah deu suanmi panga a um. Cuih tili cu Hebru ṭong in Bethzatha tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih deusuan sungah cun mina tampi an it teptep. Ṭhenkhat cu mitcaw, ṭhenkhat cu ke-awl le ṭhenkhat cu a zengmi tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />(A caancaan ah Bawipa ih vancungmi a rung ṭum ih tidai kha a cangter ṭheu. Cutiih tidai a cang vete in tili sungih a dawp hmaisa bik kha an natnak ihsin an dam ṭheu. Curuangah mina pawl cun tidai caang ding kha an hngak.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutawkah mipa pakhat kum sawm thum le kum riat sung a nami a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutawkih a ih ringring kha Jesuh in a hmu ih kum reipi a na zo ti tla a thei. Curuangah Jesuh in, “Dam na duh maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cupa in, “Bawipa, tidai a caang tikah tili sungih i hnimtu ding zohman an um lo. Tili sungah ka vung ṭum ding ka ti laifangah midang in in rak khelh ringring ṭheu,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Tho awla na ihphah la in feh aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmakhatteah cupa cu a dam; a ihphah cu a lak ih a feh. Cuih ni cu Sabbath ni a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Judah mi hotu pawl in damnak a ngahtu pa cu, “Tuih sun hi Sabbath ni a si ih na ihphah na fehpi hi kan Daan in a duh lo a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih in, “Keimah i damtertu pa in na ihphah la awla feh aw, i ti si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Annih in, “Cutiih a lo titu cu zo so a si?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain damnak a ngahtu pa cun Jesuh cu zo a si ti a thei lo, ziangahtile cutawkah miburpi an um ih an lakin Jesuh cu a rak feh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Neh hnuah cupa cu Jesuh in Biakinn sungah a tong ih, “Zohhnik! Atu cu na dam zo; curuangah va sual nawn hlah. Culole na parah thil ṭha lo sinsin a thleng ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule cupa cu a feh ih Judah mi hotu pawl hnenah, “I damtertu cu Jesuh a si,” tiah a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sabbath ni ih mi a damter ruangah cun Jesuh cu an ralsan ih harsatnak an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Ka pa cu hna a ṭuan ringring ih kei khal hna ka ṭuan ve a ṭul a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutiih a ti ruangah Judah mi hotu pawl cu an thin-ai a thok ih amah kha thah an tum sinsin; Sabbath a buar lawng si loin Pathian cu ka Pa a si, a ti ruangah Pathian tlukah a tuah aw tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in an hnenah, “Thungai in ka lo sim: Fapa cun amah tein zianghman a tuah thei lo. A Pa ih tuahmi a hmuhmi lawng kha a tuah a si. Pa in a tuahmi kha Fapa khal in a tuah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pa in a Fapa kha a duhdawt ih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah kha a hmuh ṭheh. Himi hnakin tuah ding a nasa sawn mi kha a hmuh hrih ding ih nan mang a bang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pa in mithi a thawhter ih nunnak a pek vekin Fapa khal in a duhmi poh hnenah nunnak a pe ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pa in zo ih par hmanah thuṭhennak a tuah lo. Fapa hnenah thuṭhen theinak a pe zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah Pa a upattu hmuahhmuah in Fapa khal an upat ve pei. Zokhal Fapa a upat lotu cun a thlahtu a Pa khal a upat ve lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: zokhal ka simmi a thei ih i thlahtu a zum ahcun kumkhua nunnak a nei. Thuṭhennak a tong lo ding; cutiin thihnak ihsin nunnak ah a lut zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: mithi in Pathian Fapa ih aw an thei ding; a theitu hmuahhmuah in nunnak an ngahnak caan a ra ding ih atu khalah a thleng rero zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pa amah rori cu nunnak ih hrihram a si; cuvek thotho in Fapa khal cu nunnak ih hramhri a siter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Fapa cu Milai Fapa a si ruangah thuṭhennak thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiti a si ruangah nan mangbang hlah uh; mithi hmuahhmuah in a aw an theih ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />an thlaan sung ihsin an suahnak tikcu a ra thleng ding: thil ṭha a tuahtu pawl cu nung dingah an tho sal ding; cule thil ṭha lo a tuahtu pawl cu hnon dingah an tho sal ve ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Keimah ih thu in zianghman ka tuah thei lo. Thuṭhennak ka tuah asile Pathian ih i simmi vekin ka tuah; curuangah ka thuṭhennak cu a dik a si, ziangahtile ka duhmi tuah ka tum lo, i thlahtu ih duhmi lawng tuah ka tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keimah in keimah ih thu lawng ka rel a si ahcun ka thusimmi cu a dik ngaingaimi a si, ti a theih lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka ai-ah keimah ih thu a simtu ding midang pakhat a um ih ka thu a simmi cu a dik a si, ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Johan hnenah nan palai pawl nan thlah ih amah in thutak a rak sim hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hitiih ka ti tikah theihpitu minung ka neih a ṭul ka tinak a si lo; rundamnak nan ngah theinak dingah ka simmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Johan cu a alh ih a tleumi mei-inn vek a si; a tleunak sungah caan malte sung lawng nan lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asinain ka ai-ah ka thuhla i theihpitu a um ih Johan ih thutheihpinak hnakin a tum sawn; cumicu Pa in i pekmi ka thil tuahmi pawl hi an si. Cuih ka thil tuahmi cun Pa in i thlah ti a langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule i thlahtu ka Pa khal hi ka ai-ah ka thu i theihpitu a si. A aw nan thei dah lo, a hmuihmel khal nan hmu dah lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />cule a thu simmi khal nan thinlung sungah nan ret lo, ziangahtile a thlah mipa hi nan zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ca Thianghlim sung nan hawl; cutiih nan hawlnak cu hi Ca Thianghlim sungah hin kumkhua nunnak kan hmu ding, tiah nan ruah ruangah a si. Hi Ca Thianghlim cu keimah ih thu a simtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nunnak ngah dingah ka hnenah nan ra duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Minung hnen ihsin thangṭhatnak ngah ding ka hawl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mi ziangvek nan si ti ka lo thei ih nan thinlung sungah Pathian duhdawtnak zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ka Pa ih hmin thawn ka ra naón in saang duh lo; asinain mi pakhat amah ih hmin lawng in a ra asile amah sawn cu nan rak pom ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat hnen ihsin porh le lomnak ngah nan duh zet, asinain amah lawng Pathian a si mi hnen ihsi cun thangṭhatnak ngah nan tum lo; cuti a si ahcun ziangtinso kei cu in zum thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Keimah hi Pathian ih hmaiah in mawhthluktu a si ding, tiah i ruat hlah uh. A parih ruahsannak nan neih bikmi Moses rori hi a lo mawhthluktu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moses nan zum ngah ngaingai rak sisehla keimah khal hi in zum ve ding; ziangahtile Moses in ka thu a rak ngan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Sihmansehla amah ih nganmi nan zum lo a si ahcun, ka simmi hi ziangtinso nan zum thei ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu Galilee Tili khatlam ral ah a va feh. Cuih Tili cu Tiberias Tili ti tla in an ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmuhsaknak a tuahnak in mina tampi a damtermi kha an rak hmuh zo ruangah miburpi in amah cu an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh cu tlangpar ah a hung kai ih cunah a dungthluntu pawl thawn an to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lantak Puai timi Judah mi pawl ih puai cu a nai thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in a kiangkap kha a zoh tikah miburpi in amah an pan luailo kha a hmu ih Filip hnenah, “Minung hi-hmuah ei dingah khui tawkin so rawl kan lei ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitiih a suh cu Filip hniksaknak ah a si; a ngaingai ti ahcun ziang ka tuah ding ti kha a thei cia zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Filip in, “Mi pakhat in malte fingfing co ding hmanah mi hizat ih ei ding ahcun ngun tangka za hnih man lei hmanah a daih lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dungthlun a si vemi midang pakhat, Simon Piter ih nau Andru in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hinah hin nauhak pakhat a um ih barli saang hlom nga le nga pum hnih a nei. Asinain minung hizat hrangah cun zianghman a si tham lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Mi senpi pawl cu toter hai uh,” tiah a dungthluntu pawl cu a sim. Cutawkah cun hrampi a tamzet. Cuti cun mipi cu an to ih an zatein thawng nga tluk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh in sang cu a lak ih Pathian hnenah lungawi thu a sim hnuah a tomi pawl hnenah cun a zem. Nga khal cutivek ṭhiamṭhiam in a zem ih misenpi cun an ei thei tawkin an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rawl an ei khawh tikah a dungthluntu pawl hnenah cun, “An hlahmi kha sar ṭheh uh; malte hman hlon lak hlah uhsi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutiin an hlahmi cu an sar khawm tikah barli sang hlom nga sungin mipi ih an ei hnuah a taangmi bawm hleihnih an sar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh ih tuahmi hmuhsaknak cu mipi in an hmuh tikah annih in, “Leilung ah a ra ding, timi profet cu amah rori hi a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misenpi in an siangpahrang ih tuah dingah hranhram in in ra kai ding, ti kha Jesuh in a thei; curuangah tlangpar ah amahte lawng a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zanlam khua a rung tlai tikah Jesuh ih dungthluntu pawl cu tili lamah an vung ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />lawng sungih an to hnuah tili khatlam ral, Kapernaum khualam ahcun an va kir sal. Zan a si zo ih an hnenah Jesuh cu a ra thleng hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Culai fangah thli nasa zetin a hung hrang ih tilet a tho ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Long cu an hlau ih peng thum peng li tluk an feh tikah Jesuh cu tidai parah feh tahratin anmah lamih a rat vivo kha an hmu ih an ṭih ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh in, “ṭih hlah uh; Keimah ka si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule lungawi zetin Jesuh cu an lawng sungah an kaiter ih an feh duhnak hmun ah reilote-ah an va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thaizing ah tili khatlam ralih a ummi misenpi pawl in cutawkah lawng pakhat lawng a um, cuih lawng sungah Jesuh a um lo ih a dungthluntu pawl lawng an feh a si, ti kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tiberias ihsin a rami lawng dangdang tla cu Bawipa in lungawi thu a sim hnuah misenpi in saang an einak hmun kiang tili kapah an ra thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutawkah Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl an um lo tikha misenpi in an hmuh tikah cutawkih lawng pawl to in Jesuh hawl duh ah Kapernaum ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh cu tili khatlam ralih an va hmuh tikah mipi pawl cun, “Sayapa, ziangtikah so hitawk ih na thlen?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: in ra hawl hi hmuhsaknak ka tuahmi nan theihthiam ruangah a si lo, sang khop zetih nan ei ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A siat theimi rawl hrangah hna ṭuan hlah uh; sikhalsehla kumkhua a daihmi nunnak rawl hrangah ṭuan uh. Cuih rawl cu Milai Fapa ih a lo pek dingmi a si, ziangahtile Pa Pathian in a parah a lungkimnak tacik a khen zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah annih in, “Pathian in ṭuan hai seh ti in duh sakmi tuah dingah ziangso kan tuah ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Pathian in ṭuan hai seh ti a lo duh sakmi cu a thlahmi pa zum kha a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Annih in, “Kan hmuh ih kan lo zum theinak dingah ziangvek hmuhsaknak so na tuah ding? Ziang si na tuah dingmi cu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ca Thianghlim sungih ‘An ei dingah vancung ihsin sang a pek,’ tiih a um vekin kan pupa pawl cun nelrawn ramṭhing ah khan manna sang an ei a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: Moses ih a lo pekmi cu vancung saang ngaingai a si lo. Ka Pa in vancung saang ngaingai cu a lo pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian ih a pekmi saang cu vancung ihsin a rungṭum ih leilung mi nunnak a petu pa hi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Annih in, “Bawipa, cuih saang cu in pe ringring aw,” tiah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah cun, “Keimah hi nunnak sang ka si. Ka hnenih a rami cu a ril a rawng dah lo ding; keimah i zumtu cu a ti a haal dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule ka lo sim hai zo vekin a hmuh cu in hmu zo naón in zum duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pa ih i pekmi pohpoh cu zokhal ka hnen ah an ra ding. Ka hnenih a rami cu zohman ka khir lo ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />ziangahtile vancung ihsin ka rung ṭum tikah hin keimah ih duhmi tuah dingah ka rung lo, i thlahtu ih duhmi tuah dingah ka rung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule i thlahtu ih duhmi cu hihi a si: I pekmi hmuahhmuah kha pakhat hman hloter loin, ni neta bik ni-ah an zate ih ka thawhter sal ṭheh ding kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ziang hrangah tile ka Pa ih duhmi cu Fapa kha a hmu ih a zumtu hmuahhmuah cu kumkhua nunnak an ngahnak ding kha a si. Cule ni neta bikah nunnak ah ka thoter ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Keimah hi vancung ihsin a rungmi saang ka si,” a ti ruangah Judah mi senpi pawl cu an phunzai ruri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Curuangah, “Hi pa hi Josef fapa Jesuh a si lo maw? A nu le a pa tla cu kan theih thluhmi an si ko! Ziangtin so ‘Vancung ihsin ka rung,’ tiah a ti rero thei?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Phunzai ruri nawn hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />I thlahtupa in ka hnenih a kuat lo ahcun zohman ka hnenah an ra thei lo ding; cutiih ka hnenih a rami cu ni neta bikah nunnak ah ka thoter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Profet pawl in, ‘Zokhal Pathian in a zirh hai ding,’ tiah an rak ngan. Zokhal Pa a thei ih a hnen ihsin a zirtu cu ka hnenah a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hiti ka ti tikah zokhal in Pa cu an hmu zo, tinak a si lo; Pathian hnen ihsin a ra mipa lawng hi Pa hmutu cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: a zumtu cun kumkhua nunnak a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Keimah hi nunnak saang ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nan pu le nan pa pawl cu nelrawn ramṭhing ah manna saang an ei naón an thi thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Sikhalsehla vancung ihsin a rung ṭummi saang hi a eitu hmuahhmuah cu an thi lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Keimah hi vancung ihsin a rung ṭummi saang nung ka si. Hi saang a eitu cu kumkhua in a nung ding. Ka pek dingmi saang cu hi leilung in nunnak a ngah theinak dingih ka pekmi ka taksa hi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cutiih a ti ruangah cun an lakah thinheng thu-el awknak tiang a suak ih, “Ziangtin so hi pa hin kan ei dingah a taksa cu in pek thei ding?” tiah an ti ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />An hnenah Jesuh in, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: Milai Fapa taksa nan ei lo ih a thisen tla nan in lo ahcun nan sungah nunnak nan nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Zokhal ka taksa a ei ih ka thisen a intu cu kumkhua nunnak a nei ih ni neta bikah nunnak ah ka thoter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ziangahtile ka taksa hi rawl taktak a si ih ka thisen cu in dingmi taktak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Zokhal ka taksa a ei ih ka thisen a intu cu ka sungah a nung; cule keimah khal a sungah ka nung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A nungmi Pa in i thlah ih amah ih ruangah kei khal ka nung a si. Cubangtuk thotho in keimah i eitu cu keimah ih ruangah a nung ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Vancung ihsin a rungmi saang timi cu himi hi a si; nan pu le nan pa pawl cun saang an ei ih malte a hung rei cun an thi thotho; vancung ihsin a rungmi saang cu cuvek a si lo. Hi saang a eitu ih piang cu kumkhua in an nung ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Himi cu Kapernaum khua sinakok sungih thu a zirh laiih a simmi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Amah a thluntu tampi in cuih thu cu an thei ih, “A thu zirhmi hi a hartuk ual! Zoso a thei thei ding?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />An sim lo naón cuih thu-ah an phunzai ciamco ti kha Jesuh in a thei ih an hnenah, “Himi hin nan thinlung ah buainak a suahter maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Thuṭhimnak ah Milai Fapa hi hlanih a rak umnak hmunih a hung feh sal kha hmu uhla ziangtinso nan ti ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Nunnak taktak a petu cu Thlarau a si; milai-ih taksa cu san a tlai lo. Nan hnenih ka simmi ṭongkam hi nunnak le Thlarau petu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭhenkhat cun nan zum lo,” tiah a ti. Jesuh in a hramthokte ihsin zoso i zum lotu ding, tile zoso i zuartu ding ticu a thei ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in, “Hiti a si ruangah sokhaw Pa in ka hnenih a ratter lo ahcun zohman ka hnenah an ra thei lo ding, tiah ka lo simnak kha a si cu!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh dungthluntu misenpi cun kir in an tlansan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Curuangah a dungthluntu hleihnih kha, “Nannih teh tlan nan duh ve maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Simon Piter in, “Bawipa, zo ih hnenah so kan feh cuang ding? Kumkhua nunnak petu ṭongkam a neitu cu nangmah na sisi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Cule atu cun Pathian hnen ihsin a rami Mi Thianghlim na si ti kha kan zum ih kan thei ngah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nannih hleihnih hi keimah ih hrilmi nan si, a si lo maw? Asinain pakhat cu satan a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Hitiih a ti sanmi cu Simon Iskariot ih fapa Judas kha a si. Ziangahtile Judas cu dungthluntu hleihnih lakih a telmi a si naón Jesuh zuartu ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu Galilee peng sungah khual a tlawng; cule Judea ram Judah mi hotu pawl in a thah an tum ruangah Judea peng ahcun a tlawng duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puanthlam Puai a nai zo ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />curuangah a naule pawl in Jesuh cu, “Na thil tuahmi tla hi a lo thluntu pawl in an hmuh dingah hi hmun ihsin suak awla Judea peng ah feh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi tampiih theihmi si a duhtu cun a thil tuahmi cu a thup dah keel lo. Hi bangtuk thil hi na tuah ruangah leilung pumpi in lo thei thluh hai seh!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah ih naule pawl hman in Jesuh cu an zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Ka tikcu a kim hrih lo. Nannih hrangah cun ziangtik khal hi nan tikcu a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leilung in nannih cu a lo hua lo, sikhalsehla kei cun a thil tidan a ṭha lo a si tiih ka sim ringring ruangah leilung in i hua a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puai tuahnak ahcun va feh uh. Kei cu ka tikcu a kim hrih lo ruangah ka feh lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutiin a sim ih Galilee ahcun a umta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puai ah a naule pawl cu an feh ih cuih hnuah Jesuh khal a feh ve; asinain langhngan tukih feh loin a thup deuh in a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puai hmun ahcun Judah hotu pawl cun an hawl ih, “Khui-ah so a si?” tiah an sut vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipi pawl in amah ih thuhla cu an rel ih an phun supso rero. Ṭhenkhat in, “Miṭha sokhaw a si!” an ti. Midang in, “Si hlah e, misenpi a hruai sual a sisi!” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zohman in langhngan in an ṭong ngam lo, ziangahtile Judah mi hotu upa pawl kha an ṭih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih puai tuah caan a hrek tlukah Jesuh cu Biakinn ah a feh ih thuzirh a thok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah mi hotu pawl cu an mang a bang ngaingai ih, “Hi pa hi khui hmanah zirnak a neih dah ual lo; ziangtinso hi zatzat thu a theih thei?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka thuzirhmi hi keimah palungih zirhmi a si lo; i thlahtu hnen ihsin a rami a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian duhnak tuah a tumtu zokhal in ka thuzirhmi hi Pathian hnen ihsin a ra maw, keimah palung in so ka sim, ti cu a thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zokhal sisehla amah ih thuneihnak lawngin a ṭongtu cun amah hrangah thangṭhatnak a hawl a si. Sikhalsehla amah a thlahtu hrangih thangṭhatnak a hawltu cun a sungah hrawhhrawlnak zianghman a nei lo ih zumtlak in a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses in Daan a lo pek a si lo maw? Sikhalsehla zohman in cuih Daan cu nan thlun lo. Ziangah so a thah lehlam in tum rero?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipi in, “Na sungah khuavang a um a si! Zoso thah a lo tum?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Hmuhsaknak pakhat ka tuah ih nan khawruah a har ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moses in nan fapa pawl an serh tan dingah thu a lo pek, (hi serhtannak a thoktu cu Moses a si lo, nan pupa pawl an si); cule nan fapa cu Sabbath ni ah a serh nan tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses Daan buar lonak dingah tiah nan fapa Sabbath ni ah a serh nan tan a si ahcun ziangah so kei in Sabbath ni ih mi pakhat ka damter ruangah ka parah nan thin a heng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A lenglam zohnakin thu ṭhen hlah uh; thudik a sinak zoh in thu ṭhen uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jerusalem khawsungmi ṭhenkhat in, “Judah mi hotu pawl ih thah an tummi pa cu hi pa hi a si lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zohhnik uh! Mi zapi theihhngan ah duh tawkin thu a sim ih zianghman an ti lo. Hi pa hi Messiah a si tiah an thei ngah ngaingai teh a si pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Messiah a rat tikah cun khuitawkin a ra, ti kha zohman in an thei lo ding; asinain hi pa hi cu khuitawk in a ra ti cu kan zatein kan theih ṭheh mi a si fawn,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesuh in Biakinn sungah cutiih thu a zirh rero laiah cun, aw ring zetin, “Keimah hi in thei ngaingai maw? Khuitawk ihsin ka ra ti hi nan thei ngah ngaingai maw? Keimah ih thu in ka ra lo. Asinain i thlahtu cu zumtlak ngaingai a si. Nannih in i thlahtu cu nan thei lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />asinain kei cun ka thei, ziangahtile amah in i thlah ih a hnen ihsin ka ra,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutikah amah kha kaih an tum, asinain zohman in an kai ngaingai lo; ziangahtile a tikcu a kim hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sikhalsehla misenpi sungih mi tampi in an zum ih, “Messiah a rat ngaingai tikah hi pa ih a tuahmi hnakin hmuhsaknak tam deuh a tuah pei maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesuh thuhla misenpi in an rel ruri kha Farasi pawl in an theih tikah puithiam upa pawl thawn Jesuh kaitu dingah biakinn kiltu palik pawl an thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nan hnenah tikcu malte sung ka umta hrih ding ih cuih hnuah i thlahtu hnenah ka feh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />In hawl ding naón in hmu thei lo ding, ziangahtile ka umnak ahcun nan feh thei lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Judah mi hotu pawl in pakhat le pakhat hnenah, “Kan hmuh thei lonak hmun khuitawkah so feh a tum? Kan minung pawl an umnak Grik khua pakhatkhat ah feh tahratin Grik mi pawl a zirh tum a si pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />‘In hawl ding naón in hmu lo ding. Ka umnak ahcun nan feh thei lo ding,’ tiah in ti. A sim duhmi ziang a si pei?” tiah an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Puai tuah ni neta bik le ni sunglawi bik ni ah Jesuh cu a ding ih aw ring zetin, “Zokhal ti a haal mi cu ka hnenah ra sehla ra in seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ca Thianghlim in ‘Zokhal keimah i zumtu cu a thinlung sung ihsin nunnak tiva a put ding,’ tiah a ti vekin a si ding,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hitiin Jesuh in a sim tikah amah a zumtu hmuahhmuah in Thlarau an ngahnak ding thu kha a sim duhnak a si. Cuih caan ahcun Thlarau kha pek a si hrih lo, ziangahtile Jesuh kha sunlawinak ah thlenter a si hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cutiih a ṭongmi kha miburpi lakih ṭhenkhat in an theih tikah, “Hi pa hi profet ngaingai a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A dang ṭhenkhat in, “Messiah a si,” an ti. Midang in, “Messiah cu Galilee in ra ding a si ual lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ca Thianghlim in ‘Messiah cu Siangpahrang David tesinfa a si ding ih David a rak umnak Bethlehem khua ah a suak ding,’ a ti kha!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutiin Jesuh ih ruangah cun mizapi lakah ṭhenṭhek awknak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat in a kaih an duh, asinain zohman in an kai ngaingai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Biakinn kiltu palik pawl an ra kir tikah puithiam upa pawl le Farasi pawl in, “Ziangah so nan ratpi lo?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Palik pawl cun, “Hi pa bangtuk in zohman an ṭong dah lo,” tiah an sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Cutikah Farasi pawl in, “Nannih khal a lo bum ngah ve maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Judah hotu lakah pakhat tal, a si lole Farasi lakah pakhat tal amah zumtu nan theihmi an um dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hi misenpi sawh lam cu Moses ih Daan an theih lo ruangah Pathian ih camsiatnak hnuai ah a ummi an si!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cutawkih a ummi Farasi mi lakah Nikodemas an timi, Jesuh a rak tong dah zotu kha a um ve. Anih in an hnenah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Kan Daan vekih kan rel a si ahcun mi pakhat cu amah ih hmurka kan theih hlan le a tuahmi kan hmuh ngah hlan ahcun kan hnong thei lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Nang khal Galilee mi na si ve maw si? Ca Thianghlim kha siar awla Galilee ihsin profet an suak dah lo, ti kha na thei ko ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />asinain Jesuh cu Olif Tlang parah a hung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thaisun zingthlapit ah Biakinn ah a feh sal. Mi tampi in an pan, cule Jesuh cu a to ih thu a zirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Culai fangah Daanthiam saya pawl le Farasi mi pawl in ṭaangṭawm sualnak a tuah laifang rori an kaihmi nunau nu kha an hruai ih zapi hmaiah an dinter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesuh hnen ahcun, “Sayapa, hi nunau nu hi ṭaangṭawm sualnak a tuah laifang rori-ih kaihmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan Daan sungah Moses ih thupekmi vekin cubangtuk nunau cu lungto in denthat ding a si. Nang ziangti in so na ruah?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitiih an suhnak cu Jesuh kha sual an puh theinak dingih thang an kammi a si. Asinain anih cu a kun ih leilung ah a kutzung in ca a ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutiin thu an sut rero ruangah cun Jesuh cu dingtein a hung to ih an hnenah, “Nanmah lakah sualnak a tuah dah lomi in hmaisabik ah lungto in deng uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule a kun sal ih leilung ah ca a ngan sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cumi an theih tikah an zatein pakhat hnu pakhat an tlan ṭheh: Upa upa in an tlan hmaisa. Cule Jesuh lawng a taang ih a hmaiah cuih nunau nu lawng a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dingte in a hung to sal ih a hnenah, “Khui ah so an si ṭheh? Mawh a lo phurhtu dingah zohman an taang nawn lo maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nunau nu cun, “A si Bawipa, zohman an taang lo,” tiah a ti. Jesuh in, “Cuti asile kei khal in mawh ka lo phurh lo ding, va tlung awla va sual nawn hlah,” tiah a ti.]
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesuh cun Farasi mi pawl hnenah, “Kei cu leilungih tleunak ka si. Zokhal keimah i thluntu cu a nunnak ah tleunak a nei ding ih khawthim sungah a feh dah lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Farasi pawl cun a hnenah, “Na sinak thu cu nangmah in na sim. Curuangah na simmi hi zianghman lak tlak a si lo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh in, “A si lo; keimah ih thu cu keimah in ka sim hmanah ka simmi cu a dikmi a si, ziangahtile khuitawk ihsin ka ra ti le khuitawkah ka feh ding ti ka thei. Nannih cun khuitawk ihsin ka ra ti le khuitawkah ka feh ding ti nan thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nannih cun minung ih tisa daan in thu nan ṭhen ṭheu; kei cun zo ih par hmanah thuṭhennak ka tuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain thu ka ṭhen hman va sisehla ka thuṭhennak cu a dik ding, ziangahtile hi thuṭhennak ah hin keimah lawng ka si lo, i thlahtu pa khal ka hnenah a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nan Daan cabu sungah ‘Thu theitu pahnih an lung a kimtlang a si ahcun an simmi cu a dik a si,’ tiah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keimah ih thu cu keimah in ka sim ih i thlahtu ka Pa khal in ka thu cu a sim ve,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Annih in, “Khuitawkah so na Pa cu a um?” tiah an sut. Jesuh in, “Keimah siseh, ka Pa siseh, in thei lo. Keimah in theih ahcun ka Pa khal nan thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi thu pawl a simnak cu Biakinn sungih thu a zirhnak thawhlawm kuang pawl an retnak khaan ah a simmi a si. Cule zohman in an kai lo, ziangahtile a tikcu a kim hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Kei cu ka feh ding; in hawl ding naón nan sualnak sungah nan thi ding. Ka fehnak ahcun nan feh thei lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah Judah mi hotu pawl cun, “Ka fehnak ah nan feh thei lo ding, tiah in ti. Amah le amah thah awk a tum a si pei maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nannih cu hnuailam mi nan si; asinain kei cu tlunlam mi ka si. Nannih cu hi leilung ihsin nan si, kei cu hi leilung ihsin ka si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah a si nan sualnak sungah nan thi ding, ka lo tinak cu! Cule ‘Keimah cu Keimah a si mi ka si,’ tihi in zum lo a si ahcun nan sualnak sungah nan thi rori ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Zoso na si?” tiah an sut. Jesuh in, “A hramthok ihsin ka lo simmi kha a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nan thuhla hi sim ding tampi ka nei; mawhthluk tlak nan sizia khal hi tampi rel ding ka nei. Asinain i thlahtu cu zumtlak a si ih a hnen ihsin ka theihmi lawng kha hi leilungah hin ka than,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah Pa ih thu a sim kha an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah an hnenah, “Milai Fapa hi nan thlai tikah ‘Keimah cu Keimah a si mi ka si,’ ti kha nan thei ding. Cule keimah ih thuneihnak in zianghman ka tuah lo; Pa in sim dingih i fialmi lawng ka sim a si ti nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule i thlahtu cu ka hnenah a um ih keimah lawng i tanta dah lo; ziangahtile amah ih lungkimmi lawnglawng ka tuah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi thu a simmi a theitu tampi in Jesuh cu an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in amah a zumtu pawl hnenah, “Ka thu zirhmi nan thlun ahcun keimah ih dungthluntu ngaingai nan si ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />thutak cu nan thei dingih cuih thutak cun a lo luatter ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Annih in, “Kannih cu Abraham ih tesinfa kan si ih zo ih sal hman kan si dah lo. ‘Miluat nan si ding,’ na ti tikah hin ziangso na ti duh san?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: zokhal sisehla sualnak a tuahtu cu sualih sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sal cu innsang sungah kumkhua in a um thei lo; asinain fapa cu innsang sungah kumkhua in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Fapa in a lo luatter a si ahcun miluat taktak nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Abraham ih tesinfa nan si cu ka thei. Asinain a thah in tum thotho, ziangahtile ka thu zirhmi nan pom thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka Pa ih i hmuhmi thu ka lo sim; sikhalsehla nannih cun nan pa ih a lo simmi kha nan tuah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Annih in, “Kan pa cu Abraham a si,” tiah an ti. Jesuh in “Abraham ih faate nan si ngaingai ahcun a tuahmi vek nan tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ziang hmuahhmuah ka tuahmi hi Pathian hnen ihsin thutak ka theihmi pawl ka lo simnak a si; asinain nannih cun a thah lawnglawng in tum. Abraham in cubangtuk thil zianghman a tuah lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nannih nan tuahmi hi cu nan pa ih tuahmi a si,” tiah a ti. Annih in, “Pathian amah lawng hi kan Pa cu a si ih kannih hi a fa taktak kan si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Pathian hi nan Pa si taktak sehla keimah hi in duh ding; ziangahtile Pathian hnen ihsin ka ra ih atu hinah ka um. Keimah ih thu in ka ra lo; amah ih thlahmi ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ka simmi hi ziangah so nan theih thei lo? Ka thu simmi hi nan tuar thei lo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nannih cu nan pa Satan ih fa nan si; nan pa ih duhnak nan thlun duh ve a si. A hramthok ihsin anih cu mithat a si ih thutak lam ahcun a ṭang dah lo, ziangahtile anih cu a sungah thutak a um lo. Anih in thuphan a per tikah amah ih si daan a thlun vemi a si, ziangahtile anih cu thuphan pertu a si ih thuphan hmuahhmuah ih pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Asinain kei cun thutak ka sim ih curuangah nannih cun in zum duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nanmah lakah hin sualnak na tuah a si, tiah i hmuh theitu pakhat tal nan um maw? Thutak ka sim naón ziangah so in zum duh lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian hnen ihsin a rami cun Pathian ih ṭongkam a ngai. Sikhalsehla nannih cu Pathian hnen ihsin a rami nan si lo ruangah a thu nan ngai duh lonak hi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Judah mi pawl cun Jesuh cu, “Nang cu Samaria mi na si ih na sungah khuavang a um, kan lo ti tikah kan dik a si lo maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Khuavang ka nei lo; kei in ka Pa cu ka sunloih, nannih in kei cu in nautat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Keimah ih hrangah hminthannak ka hawl lo. Asinain sunlawinak a hawltu pakhat a um ih amah cu ka lam ṭangin thuṭhentu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: zokhal ka thu a thluntu cu a thi dah lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Annih in Jesuh cu, “Atu-ah cun khuavang na nei a si, ti kan theifiang sinsin! Ziangtin tile Abraham cu a thi zo, profet pawl khal an thi ṭheh zo; asinain nang in na thu a thluntu cu an thi lo ding, tiah na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Cun mi hmuahhmuah cu an inn ciarah an tlung; Kan Pa Abraham cu a thi zo; Abraham hnakih tum sawnah na ruat aw maw si? Cule profet pawl tla an thi zo; zo ka si tiin so na ruah awk?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Keimah ih hminthannak ka hawl a si ahcun cuih hminthannak cu zianghman a si lo ding. Kei i sunloihtu cu ka Pa a si ih ‘Kan Pathian a si’ nan timi rori hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Nannih cun nan thei dah lo; asinain kei cun ka thei. Amah cu ka thei dah lo ka ti ahcun nanmah vek thotho in thuphan pertu ka si ding. Sikhalsehla amah cu ka thei taktak ih a thu khal ka thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nan pa Abraham cu ka ratnak ding tikcu caan hmuh duh in a hngakhlap zet; a hmu ngah ngaingai ih a lung a awi zet a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Annih in, “Kum sawmnga hman na kim hrih lo sikhawh ziangtinso Abraham cu na hmuh?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: Abraham a suah hlan khalah Keimah a si mi ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Cule lungto an sar ih den an tum, asinain Jesuh cu a relh ih Biakinn ihsin a feh hlo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh cu cutiih a feh rero laiah a suah ihsin a mit a cawmi pa pakhat a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A dungthluntu pawl in, “Sayapa, zo ih sualnak ruangah so mitcaw in a suah? Amah ih sualnak ruangah maw, a nu le a pa ih sualnak ruangah so?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesuh in, “A mit a cawtnak hi amah ih sualnak ruangah a si lo, a nu le a pa ih sualnak ruang khalah a si lo. Pathian thil ti theinak hi hi pa damternak ihsin a langnak ding ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sun a si sung ahcun i thlahtu ih hna kan ṭuan rero a ṭul. Zan a ra thleng cing ding ih zohman hna an ṭuan thei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leilung tlunih ka um sungah cun keimah hi leilung tleunak ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutiih a ti hnuah Jesuh in leilungah cil a phui ih cuih a cil in leivut a beekter hnuah cu pa ih mit ahcun a man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cu hnuah, “Va feh awla Siloam Tili ah na hmai va phiah aw,” tiah a ti. Siloam timi cu Tirhthlah tican a si. Cuti cun cupa cu a feh ih a hmai cu a phiah, khua a hmu thei sal ih a ra kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A innhnen pawl le tuih hlanih rawl dil in a hmu ṭheutu pawl in “Hi pa hi to hmun in tangka a dil ṭheutu kha a si lo maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat in, “Amah a si ko,” tiah an ti. Midang in, “Amah a si lo; amah vek midang a si,” tiah an ti. Cupa amah rori in, “Nan timi pa cu ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Annih in, “Ziangtin so atu-ah khua na hmuh thei sal?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih in, “Jesuh an timi pa in ciarbek malte a tuah ih ka mit ah i man hnu ah Siloam ah va feh awla na hmai va phiah aw tiah i ti. A ti vekin ka feh ih ka hmai ka phiah vete in khua ka hmu thei sal a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Annih in, “Cupa cu khui-ah so a um?” tiah an sut. Anih in, “Ka thei lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule annih in mitcaw dah pa cu Farasi pawl hnenah an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh in ciarbek a tuah ih a mitcawtnak a damter ni cu Sabbath ni a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah Farasi mi pawl cun a mit khua a hmuhnak thu cu an sut sal. Anih in, “Ka mit ah ciarbek a run hnih, cule ka hmai ka phiah ih ka hmu thei a si ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Farasi mi ṭhenkhat in, “Hi bangtuk thil a tuahtu pa cu Pathian hnen ihsin a rami a si thei lo ding, ziangahtile Sabbath daan a thlun lo a si,” tiah an ti. Midang pawl in, “Misual a si ahcun hi bangtuk hmuhsaknak cu ziangtinso a tuah thei ding?” tiah an ti ve. Cutiin an lakah ṭhenawknak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah Farasi mi pawl in cupa cu thu an sut sal ih, “Na mit a lo vangter sikhawh cupa cu ziangti in na ruat?” tiah an sut. Anih in, “Profet a si tiah ka ruat,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah mi hotu pawl cun mitcaw pa thu cu a nu le a pa an sut ngah hlanah cun mitcaw in a suak ih atu-ah khua a hmu thei ticu an zum duh hrimhrim lo. Curuangah a nu le a pa cu an ko ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hi pa hi nan fa a si maw? Mitcaw in a suak tiah nan ti; cuti asile ziangtinso atu-ah khua a hmuh thei?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nu le a pa cun, “Amah hi kan fapa a si ti kan thei; cule mitcaw in a suak ti kan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ziangti in atu-ah khua a hmu thei ti le a mitcawtnak hi zo in a damter ti khal kan thei lo. Amah sut uh; upa a si ve thlang ih amah in a lo let thei ko hai ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nu le a pa cun cutiin an sim, ziangahtile Judah mi hotu pawl an ṭih ruangah a si. Judah mi hotu pawl cun: zokhal Jesuh hi Messiah a si tiah ka zum a timi poh cu sinakok ihsin suah siseh, tiah lungkimnak an rak nei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah a nu le a pa in, “Upa a si ve thlang ih amah sut uh,” tiah an tinak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mitcaw pa cu a voihnihnak an ko sal ih, “Thudik ka sim ding tiah Pathian hmaiah thu kam aw! A lo damtertu pa hi misual a si hrimhrim ti kan thei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cupa cun, “Misual a si le si lo kei ka thei lo. Asinain pakhat cu ka thei: ka mit a rak caw naón atu cu khua ka hmu thei zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Annih in, “Ziangtin so a lo tuah?” tiah an sut. “Na mit cawtnak cu ziangtinso a lo damter?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anih in, “Ka lo sim zo hai naón nan ngai duh lo. Ziangah so a theih sal cu nan duh? Nannih tla amah thluntu si nan duh ve maw si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah annih in cupa cu an camriam ih, “Nangmah sawn hi cupa ih dungthluntu na si. Kannih cu Moses thluntu kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian in Moses hnenah thu a sim, ti kan thei; sikhalsehla kha pa cu khuitawkin a ra ti hman kan thei dah lo!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cupa cun, “Hi thil cu a va mak so! Nannih cun khuitawk ihsin a ra ti nan thei lo, asinain kei cu ka mitcaw i vanter!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian in misual pawl ih ṭongkam a ngai dah lo ti kan thei; asinain amah a upattu le a duhnak a tuahtu pawl ih ṭongkam cu a ngai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mitcaw ciaih a suakmi khua a hmuter theitu an um ti hi leilung hramthok ihsin zohman in kan thei dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi pa hi Pathian hnen ihsin rami a si lo ahcun zianghman tuah theimi a nei lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Annih in, “Sualnak sungah a suak ih sualnak lakih a ṭhang mi pa nang lamlam in maw thuzirh in tum ve?” tiah an ti ih sinakok inn ihsin an dawihlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cubangtuk thil hmuahhmuah cu Jesuh in a theih tikah cupa cu a hmu ih, “Milai Fapa hi na zum maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cupa cun “Bawipa, cupa cu zoso a si? Amah ka zum theinak dingah i simhnik aw!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Amah cu na tong zo ih atuih a lo bia rerotu hi a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cupa in, “Bawipa, ka zum!” ti phah in Jesuh hmaiah cun a khuk a bilh ih a biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Hi leilungah hin thuṭhen dingah ka ra; cumicu mitcaw in khua an hmu ih khua a hmumi pawl in an mit a cawtnak dingah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Farasi mi ṭhenkhat cutawkah an um ih cutiih a simmi a theitu pawl in, “Kannih khal hi mitcaw nan si ve in ti duhnak a si maw?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Mitcaw rak si uhcila mawhthluk nan si lo ding; sikhalsehla khua kan hmu thei nan ti ruangah hin mawhthluk nan si ih nan sualnak cu a taanglai a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: tuu inn sungah sangka in lut loin hmun dang in a kai ih a luttu cu rukru le suamhmang an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />sangka in a luttu cu tuu a khaaltu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />sangka kiltu pa in a hrangah sangka cu a on sak. A tuu pawl cu an hminin a ko ih a aw cu an thei ih lengah a suahpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutiih a suahpi hnuah a tuu pawl hmaiah a feh ih a tuu in an thlun; ziangahtile a aw kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midang cu zohman an thlun lo ding; ziangahtile a aw an theih thiam lo ruangah a hnen ihsin an tlan hlo sawn ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesuh in hi tahṭhimnak hi a sim, asinain a sim duhmi ih tican cu an thei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesuh in hiti in a sim sal, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: Kei cu tuu hrangah sangka ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hlan ih a ratu hmuahhmuah cu rukru le suamhmang an si ruangah tuu in an aw an ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei cu sangka ka si. Keimah ih sungin a luttu cu rundammi a si ding. An lut an suak ding ih hrampi a hningmi an hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rukru cu ru ding, that ding le siatsuah ding lawnglawngah a ra. Kei cu nunnak an ngah ih tlamtling zetih an neihnak dingah ka ra a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei cu tuukhal ṭha, tuu hrangih a nunnak a pe siangtu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuukhal ngaingai a si lomi, a man phalh in fialcop mipa, amah in tuu a nei dah ve lomi cun cinghnia a rat kha a hmuh tikah tuu kha a tanta ih a tlan hlohsan. Cutiin cinghnia in a tuu cu a deh ih a ṭhekdarh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Manphalh ih fial mipa cu a tlan hlo, ziangahtile man phalhcop menmi a si ih tuu zawn a ruat ngaingai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei cu tuukhal ṭha ka si. Ka Pa in i thei ih kei khal in ka Pa cu ka theih vekin ka tuu pawl cu ka thei ih annih khal in in thei ve. Cule an hrangah ka nunnak tiangin ka pe siang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi tuurual sungih a tel lomi tuu dang ka nei. Annih khal ka finkhawm ve hai ding. Ka aw an thei ding ih tuukhal pakhat hnuai-ah tuuruun pakhat ah an cang ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pa in i duhdawt, ziangahtile ka nunnak hi lungtho tein ka pek siang a si; cutiih ka pek siannak cu ka lak sal theinak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka nunnak cu zohman in in lak sak thei lo. Keimahte siang zetin ka pekmi a si. Keimah in pek theinak thu ka nei ih lak sal theinak thu khal ka nei. Cumi cu ka tuah dingah ka Pa in thu i pek zomi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutiih a ṭong ruangah mipi pawl cu an ruahnak a ṭhen aw lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi tampi in, “Khuavang a nei. A aa thla a si! Ziangah so a thu nan ngai?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭhenkhat in, “Khuavang nei cun hi bangtuk in a ṭong lo ding! Ziangtin so khuavang nei in mitcaw cu a damter thei ding?” tiah an ti ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawsik laifang a si ih Biakinn Apnak Puai kha Jerusalem ah an tuah rero laifang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biakinn sungih Solomon Hulhliap timi ah Jesuh a feh laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah mi an ra ih, “Ziangtik tiangso awloksong in in ret ding? Thufel in simhnik: Messiah na si maw?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka lo sim zo naón in zum duh lo. Ka Pa ih thu in ka tuahmi thil pawl hin ka thuhla hmuahhmuah cu an langter ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asinain ka tuurual nan si lo ruangah nan zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka tuu pawl cun ka aw an ngai; keimah in ka thei hai ih annih in in thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hnenah kumkhua nunnak ka pek ih ziangtik hmanah an thi nawn lo ding. Zohman in in lawng thei fawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anmah ka hnenih i petu ka Pa cu ziangzongza hnakin a tum ih amah ih kut sung ihsin zohman in an lawng thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka Pa le keimah cu pakhat kan si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun mipi in amah deng dingah lungto an sar lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Nan mit hmuh rori ah ka Pa in tuah dingih i fialmi thil ṭha tampi ka tuah zo; khuimi bik ruangah hin so lungto ih den in tum?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Annih in, “Lungto ih kan lo den duhnak cu thil ṭha na tuahmi ruangah a si lo, Pathian na hmuhsuam ruangah a si sawn! Nang cu milai menmen na si, asinain Pathian tlukah na tuah aw!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnen ah, “Nan Daan cabu sungah Pathian in ‘Nannih cu pathian nan si,’ ti in nganmi a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ca Thianghlim ih simmi cu kumkhua in a dikmi a si ti kan thei; cule Pathian in a thu a simmi minung pawl kha ‘pathian,’ tiin a ko hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kei cu ka Pa ih hrilmi le leilung ah i thlahmi ka si. Cuti asile ziangtinso keimah hi Pathian Fapa ka si ka ti ruangah Pathian hmuhsuamtu na si, in ti thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pa ih duhmi thil pawl ka tuah lo a si ahcun i zum duh hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka tuah a si ahcun keimah in zum duh lo hmanah ka tuahmi tal cu nan zum dingah a mawi a si; cuticun Pa cu ka sungah a um ih Pa sungah kei ka um a si, ti nan theih ringringnak dingah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cutikah Jesuh cu a kaih an tum lala, asinain an kaih ngah hlanah a suak hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cun Jesuh cu Jordan tiva khatlam ral, Johan in baptisma a rak peknak hmunah khan a va kir sal ih cunah a caam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mi tampi a hnenah an ra ih, “Johan in hmuhsaknak zianghman a tuah lo. Asinain hi pa ih thuhla a simmi hmuahhmuah cu a dik ṭheh a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cutawkah mi tampi in amah cu an zum.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bethani khua ih a ummi Lazaras an timi pa cu a na. Bethani cu Mari le a u Martha an umnak khua a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi Mari cu Bawipa ih ke ah zihmui a toih ih a sam in a hnawttu nu kha a si. A na mi Lazaras cu a ṭa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An unau in Jesuh hnenah, “Bawipa, na duhdawtmi na rualpa a na a si,” tiah thu an hei cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cumi cu Jesuh in a theih tikah, “Hi natnak cu Lazaras ih thihnak ding natnak a si lo. Hi natnak cu Pathian sunlawinak langter dingah le Pathian Fapa in sunlawinak a ngahnak ding khalah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh in Martha le a nau nu le Lazaras cu a duhdawt zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain Lazaras a na ti thu a theih hnuah cuih a umnak ahcun a hlei in ni hnih a caam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Judea ah va feh sal uhsi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl cun, “Sayapa, kan dung rei lote ah mipi in cutawkah lungto in den an lo tum zo; atu na va feh sal ding maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ni khatah nazi hleihnih a um a si lo maw? Zokhal sun vangih a fehtu cu a bah dah lo, ziangahtile leilungih a ummi tleunak a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla khawthim sungih a feh ahcun a bah, ziangahtile tleunak a nei lo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cumi a sim ṭheh in Jesuh cun, “Kan rual Lazaras cu a itthat zo; asinain ka feh ding ih ka va ṭhang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl in, “Bawipa, a it a si ahcun a dam ko ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesuh ih sim duhmi cu Lazaras a thi, tinak kha a si ih dungthluntu pawl cun itthat menmen a ti si hmang, tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Jesuh in fiangtein a sim ih, “Lazaras cu a thi zo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />asinain nan hrangah nan zum theinak dingah a hnenih ka rak um lo cu ka lung a awi a si; tho uhla a hnenah kan feh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thomas (Faphir an timi pa) in dungthluntu a rualpi pawl hnenah, “Sayapa thawn thi tlang dingah feh uhsi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh a va thlen tikah Lazaras an phumnak ni li a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bethani cu Jerusalem ihsin peng hnih kim deuh lo a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah mi tampi cu an ṭapa ih thih sanmi Martha le Mari topi dingah an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh a ra lai rero ti kha Martha in a theih tikah amah hmuak dingah a feh, asinain Mari cu inn ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Martha cun Jesuh hnenah, “Bawipa, hinah rak um ta cila ka ṭapa cu a thi lo ding naón!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu hmanah hin Pathian in na dilmi cu a lo pe ko ding ti ka thei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Na ṭapa cu a nung sal ding,” tiah Martha cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Martha in, “A si, ni neta bikah cun a tho sal leh ding ti cu ka thei,” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh in a hnenah, “Kei cu thawhsalnak le nunnak ka si. Zokhal keimah i zumtu cu thi hmansehla an nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zokhal keimah sungah a nungmi le i zumtu cu an thi nawn lo ding. Himi hi na zum maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Martha in, “A si Bawipa, nang cu leilung ah a ra dingmi Pathian ih Fapa Messiah na si ti ka lo zum,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutiih a sim hnuah Martha cu a vung kir ih a thupte in a nau Mari kha a ko. “Sayapa hinah a um ih a lo hlam a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cumi cu Mari in a theih tikah a pok ih hmuak dingah zamrangin a va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh cu khawsungah a ra thleng hrih lo; Martha ih a tonnak hmun ah khan a um lai hrih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mari a topitu le a hnemtu pawl cu Mari a pok ih zamrangin a feh kha an hmuh tikah amah cu an thlun ve. Thlaan ah a va ṭap hmang ding tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesuh umnak ahcun Mari cu a va thleng ih Jesuh a hmuh vete in a ke hramah cun a khuk a bilh ih, “Bawipa, hitawk ah rak umta cila ka ṭapa a thi lo ding naón!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jesuh in Mari le a topitu mipi pawl tla an ṭah kha a hmuh tikah a thin a na ih a lung a hno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Khuitawkah so nan phum?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Bawipa, ra awla ra zoh aw,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule Jesuh cu a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipi in, “Lazaras cu a va duhdawt lawmmam so!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭhenkhat in, “Mitcaw pa mit a vangter a si lo maw? Lazaras hi thi loin ziangah so a tuah ve lo?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh cu a ning a hang ngaingai ih thlaan ah a va feh. Cuih thlaan cu lungkua a si ih a ka cu lungpheng pakhat in an khar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Lungpheng hi ṭhawn uh,” tiah thu a pek. Mithi pa ih farnu Martha in, “Bawipa, a nam zo ding. Kan phumnak ni li a si zo!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesuh in a hnenah, “Na zum taktak a si ahcun Pathian sunlawinak na hmu ding, tiah ka lo sim zo a si lo maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cule lungpheng cu an ṭhawn. Jesuh in tlunlam a hun zoh ih, “Ka Pa, ka simmi i ngai ruangah na parah ka lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka ṭong i theih sak ringring ti ka thei, asinain hitawk ih a ummi pawl hin nangmah thlahmi ka si kha an zum theinak dingah anmah ruangah hiti ih ka lo simnak hi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutiih a sim hnuah aw ring zetin, “Lazaras, ra suak aw!” tiah a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lazaras cu, a kut le a ke ruaktuamnak puan in an tuam ih a hmai tla an tuam; cutiih an ṭemnak thawn a ra suak ngaingai. Jesuh in, “Phoih uhla feh seh!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mari topi dingih a rami Judah mi tampi in Jesuh ih thil tuahmi cu an hmuh tikah amah cu an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭhenkhat cu Farasi pawl hnenah an kir ih Jesuh ih thil tuahmi cu an sim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Curuangah Farasi pawl le puithiam upa pawl cu Khonsil pawl thawn an tong aw ih, “Ziangtin so kan tuah ding? Hi pa ih hmuhsaknak a tuah vivomi hi zohhnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hitiih kan zoh men ringring a si ahcun mi hmuahhmuah in amah hi an zum ding ih cutikah Rom Acozah thuneitu pawl in kan Biakinn le kan miphun an siatsuah ṭheh ding a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Anmah lakih mi pakhat, Kaiafas an timi, cuih kumah Puithiam Saang a ṭuantu in, “Nan va aa so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mi tampi ai-ih mi pakhat thih cu miphun phunkhat a pumpi ih siatral ṭheh hnak cun a ṭha deuh a si, ti nan thei lo maw si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A ngaingai ti ahcun cutiih a ṭong cu a palungih ṭongmi a si lo; cuih kum cu amah Puithiam Saang a si vekin Judah miphun ai-ah Jesuh cu a thi ding, tiah profet bangin a rak simsungmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A thihnak ding cu anmah hrang lawngah si loin hmun kipih a ṭhekdarh awmi Pathian minung pawl pumkhat ih finkhawmnak ding khalah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Cuih ni thok ihsin Judah mi hotu pawl cun Jesuh that dingah thu an phiar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Curuangah Judea pengah Jesuh cu zapi hmuh in khual a tlawng nawn lo; cutawk ihsin a suak ih ramṭhing kiangih a ummi Efraim an timi khua ah a feh ih cunah a dungthluntu pawl thawn an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Judah mi pawl ih Lantak Puai caan a nai thlang ih mi tampi cu puai tuah hlan thianfaiter awknak tuah dingah an khawte ihsin Jerusalem ah an feh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Annih in Jesuh cu an hawl; Biakinn sungih an tonkhawm awk tikah pakhat le pakhat, “Ziangtin nan ruat? Puai tuahnak ahcun a ra ngai pei maw?” tiah an sut aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Puithiam upa le Farasi pawl in, “Jesuh umnak a theitu nan um ahcun kan kaih theinak dingah in sim pei,” tiah thu an than.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lantak Puai hlan ni ruk ah Jesuh cu Bethani ah thihnak ihsin a thawhter sal mi Lazaras te ih inn ah khan a va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutawkah a hrangah zanriah an suang ih Martha in rawl pek a bawm. Jesuh thawn cabuai ih rawl a eitu lakah Lazaras cu a tel ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Mari in a phun a ṭha zet le a man a khung zetmi zihmui thawl khat a lak ih Jesuh ih ke ah a toih hnuah a sam in a hnawtsak. Cuih zihmui rim cu inn sung a khat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesuh dungthluntu lakih pakhat, Jesuh a zuartu ding Judas Iskariot in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ziangah so hi zihmui cu tangka zathum ah zuar in cuih tangka cu mi farah an ṭhen sawn lo?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitiih a sim tikah mi farah pawl zawn a ruah ruangah a si lo; rukru a si ruangah a si sawn. Tangka bawm kha amah in a keng ih cuih tangka cu amah hrangah a hmang ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh in, “Hi nu hi mawhthluk hlah uh! Ka ruak phum ni hrangih a tuah dingmi cu tuah ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mifarah cu nan lakah an um ringring ko ding; asinain kei cu nan lakah ka um ringring lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah mi tampi in Bethani ah Jesuh a um ti an theih tikah cutawkah cun an feh. Jesuh hmuh duh lawngah si loin Jesuh in thlaan ihsin a thawhter salmi Lazaras hmuh duh hrimhrim ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah puithiam upa pawl in Lazaras khal thah ve dingah thu an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziangahtile Judah mi tampi in Lazaras ruangah hin anmah puithiam upa pawl cu hnon an tong ih Jesuh sawn kha an zum ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thaisun ah Lantak Puai ih a rami miburpi in Jesuh cu Jerusalem ah a ra ding, ti kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuhrangah tuum hnah an lak ih amah hmuak dingah feh phah in, “Pathian cu thangṭhat uh! Bawipa ih hminin a ratu cu Pathian in thlawsuahnak pe hram seh! Pathian in Israel Siangpahrang cu malsawm hram seh!” tiah an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesuh in laak note pakhat a hmu ih a parah a to; Ca Thianghlim in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Maw Zion khawpi, Na thinphang hlah; Na Siangpahrang cu laak note parah to-in a ra lai a si,” tiah a ti bangtuk in a kim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A dungthluntu pawl in culaiah cun hi thu ih tican hi an rak thei lo. Asinain Jesuh kha sunlawinak ih thawhter sal a si tikah amah thu-ah hin Ca Thianghlim in hi bangtuk in a rak sim ih amah hrangah hi bangtuk in an tuah a si, ti kha an vun mang sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in Lazaras kha thlaan ihsin a ko suak ih thihnak ihsin a thawhter laiih a rak hmu vetu mi tampi in cuih thu cu midang tampi an sim sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cubangtuk hmuhsaknak a tuah a si ti kha an theih ruangah miburpi in an rak hmuahnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Farasi pawl cun, “Kan ti tho lo maw; kan kham thei nawn lo hi! Zohhnik uh, leilung pumpi in a thlun zo hi!” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih puai ih Pathian bia dingah Jerusalem ih a hung fehtu mi tampi lakah cun Grik mi tla an tel ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Filip hnenah an feh ih, “Sayapa, Jesuh hmuh kan duh,” tiah an va ti. Filip cu Galilee peng Bethsaida khuami a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Filip cu Andru hnenah a feh ih a va sim; cule an pahnih in Jesuh hnenah an va feh ih an va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Milai Fapa in sunlawinak a ngahnak caan a ra thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: sangvut ci fangkhat cu lei lung sungah tuh ih a thihta lo ahcun amah keel in a taang ringring. A thihta hnu lawngah ci tampi a suahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cubangtuk in zokhal amah ih nunnak a duhtu cun a nunnak cu a sung ding; asinain zokhal hi leilung ah amah ih nunnak a huatu cun kumkhua hrangin a nunnak cu a neita ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zokhal keimah i rian duhtu cun i thlun hrimhrim a ṭul ding ih ka umnak ah a um ve ding. Cule zokhal keimah i riantu cu ka Pa in upatnak a pe ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka thinlung a baang tuk; ziangso ka sim ding? ‘Ka Pa, hi caan hi ka parah thlenter hram hlah aw,’ ka ti ding maw? Asinain hi tuarnak sungih thleng dingah leilung tlunih ka rat sannak cu hihi a si fawn!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka Pa, na hmin cu sunloih ko aw,” tiah a ti. Cule van ihsin aw a rung thang ih, “Ka sunloih zo ih ka sunloih sal hrih ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuih aw cu cutawkih a dingmi miburpi in an theih tikah mi ṭhenkhat in, “Khua a ri,” tiah an ti; a ṭhen in, “Vancungmi in a run bia a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh in an hnenah, “Hi aw a rung than hi keimah ih hrangah a si lo, nanmah ih hrangah a si sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi leilung hi thuṭhennak a ton caan a kim zo; atu-ah hi leilung uktu cu dawi hlo a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leilung ihsin khai ka si tikah mi hmuahhmuah ka hnenah ka hiip thluh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hitiih a ti tikah ziangbangtuk thihnak a tuar ding ti kha a langternak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Miburpi in, “Kan Daan in Messiah cu kumkhua in a nung ding, tiah in sim. Cuti asile ziangtinso Milai Fapa cu khai a si ding tiah nang in na ti? Hi Milai Fapa hi zoso a si?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Tleunak cu nan hnenah tikcu malte sung a um hrih ding. Tleunak nan neih sungah nan fehnak lamzinah cun feh hrih ko uh; cuti cun thimnak in a lo man lo ding; ziangahtile khawthim sungih a feh pawl cun khuilamah kan feh ti an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cuhrangah tleunak nan neih laiah cun, tleunak ih minung nan si theinak dingah, tleunak cu zum uh,” tiah a ti. Cutiih Jesuh in a sim hnuah a suak ih an hmuh thei lonak hmun ah a relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An mithmuh rori ah hmuhsaknak tampi a tuah naón amah cu an zum lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cumi cu profet Isaiah in: “Bawipa, kan thu simmi cu zo in so an zum? Zo hnenah so Bawipa in a huham a langter?” tiah a rak timi a kimnak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule an zum thei thotho lo, ziangahtile Isaiah thotho in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Pathian in an mit a cawtter ih, An thinlung khal a pitter. Cuti a si lo ahcun an mit in an hmu pang ding ih, An thinlung in an thei pang ding; Ka lam an hoi pang ding ih, A dam tla ka damter pang ding, tiah Pathian in a ti,” tiin a rak sim fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Isaiah in hiti a simnak cu Jesuh sunlawinak kha a rak hmu cia zo ih a thu khal a rak sim zo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cutiin a si ruangah Judah mi hotu tampi in Jesuh cu an zum; Sikhalsehla Farasi pawl in sinakok ihsin in suah pang ding ti phan ah Jesuh an zumnak cu langhngan in an sim ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pathian hnenih sunlawinak ngah hnakin minung hnenih sunlawinak ngah an duh sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jesuh cun aw ring zetin, “Zokhal keimah i zumtu cu keimah i zum lawng a si lo, i thlahtu khal a zum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Zokhal keimah i hmutu cu i thlahtu khal a hmu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Zokhal keimah i zumtu cu khawthim sungih a um lonak dingah hi leilung tlunah hin tleunak in ka ra zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Zokhal ka thu simmi a thei ih a thlun lotu cu kei cun a thu ka ṭhen lo ding. Leilung thuṭhen dingah ka ra lo, rundam dingah ka ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Zokhal i hnongtu le ka thu simmi a pom lotu cu thuṭhentu pakhat a nei. Ka ṭongmi hi ni neta bik ni ah a thuṭhentu ah a cang ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ziangahtile keimah thuneihnak huham ih ka simmi a si lo, i thlahtu ka Pa in ka ṭong ding le ka sim ding kha thu i pek vekin ka sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cule a thupekmi cu kumkhua nunnak a si ti ka thei. Curuangah ka simmi hi ka Pa in sim dingih i fialmi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lantak Puai ni a thlennak ding ni khat lawng a duh thlang. Jesuh in hi leilung fehsan in a Pa hnenih a fehnak tikcu a ra thleng zo ti kha a thei. Leilung tlunih a ummi amah ih ta a si mi pawl cu a duhdawt zet ringring ih a netnak tiangin a duhdawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu zanriah an hil tlang. Satan in Jesuh zuarnak ding ruahnak cu Simon Iskariot ih fapa Judas thinlung sungah a umter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka Pa in thuneihnak hmuahhmuah i pe zo ti kha Jesuh in a thei; Pathian hnen ihsin ka ra ih Pathian hnenah ka feh sal ding ti khal a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah cabuai ihsin a tho ih a angki fual a phoih hnuah taaingerh puante a taai ah a vel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule kheng kuumpi sungah tidai a thlet hnuah a dungthlun pawl ih ke a kholhsak ih a taai ih a velmi puante in a hnawt vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simon Piter hnen a thlen tikah anih in, “Bawipa, ka ke i kholh ngaingai ding maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Hitiih ka tuahmi hi atu ahcun a sullam na thei lo, asinain neh hnuah na thei sal leh ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Piter in, “Ka ke cu ziangtik khalah i kholhsak hrimhrim lo ding,” a ti. Jesuh in, “Na ke ka lo kholh lo a si ahcun ka hnenah na tel thei nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simon Piter in, “Bawipa, cuti a si ahcun, ka ke lawng i kholh hlah! Ka kut le ka lu khal i kholh aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zokhal tikholh cia a si mi cu a pumpuluk in a fai zo; a ke dah ti lo cu a kholh awk sal a ṭul lo. Nan zatein nan fai ṭheh zo, pakhat siar lo cu!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh in zo in so i zuar ding, ti a thei cia. Curuangah nan zatein nan thiang a si, pakhat siar lo cu, tiah a tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesuh cu a dungthluntu pawl ih ke a kholhsak hnuah a angki fual cu a hruk sal ih a tonak cabuai ah a to sal. “Atu nan parih ka tuahmi thil hi a tican nan thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nannih in, ‘Sayapa,’ tile ‘Bawipa,’ tiin in ko ih nan dik a si, ziangahtile in ti vekin ka si ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nan Bawipa le nan Sayapa keimah in nan ke ka lo kholh zo. Curuangah nannih khal pakhat le pakhat nan ke nan kholh aw ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nan hrangih thil ka tuahmi vek cekci in nan tuah venak dingah nan mithmuh ah zohṭhim ding ka tuah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: sal cu a bawipa hnakin a tum sawn lo; tirhthlahmi khal thlahtu hnakin a tum sawn dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi thu pawl nan thei zo ih nan thlun ngaingai a si ahcun ziangtluk mi lungawi so nan si ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hitiih ka ṭong tikah nan zate ih thu ka rel lo. Ka hrilmi pawl cu keimah in ka thei. Sikhalsehla Ca Thianghlim in ‘Keimah thawn rawl a ei tlangtu pa in i dodal a si,’ a timi cu a kim a ṭul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi thil cu a kim hlanah ka lo sim: cutiin a hung kim ngaingai tikah ‘Keimah cu Keimah a si mi ka si’ tihi nan zum leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: Keimah ih ka tirhthlahmi zokhal a rak pomtu cu keimah khal i pom a si; cule keimah i pomtu cu keimah i thlahtu khal a pom ve a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutiin Jesuh in a sim hnuah a thin a nuam lo ngaingai ih langhngan in, “Thungaite in ka lo sim: nanmah lakah pakhat in i zuar ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dungthluntu pawl cu pakhat le pakhat an zoh aw ih a tisanmi hi zo a si pei tiah mangbang awloksong in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dungthluntu lakih pakhat, Jesuh ih a duh zetmi pa cu Jesuh kiang ah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simon Piter in cupa cu a kut a hei zaap ih, “A tisanmi zo a si, sut hnik,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Curuangah dungthluntu cun Jesuh a hei naih deuh ih, “Na tisanmi hi zoso a si, Bawipa?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Sang hi kheng sungah ka hnim pei ih ka pek dingmi pa hi a si,” tiah a ti. Cutiin Jesuh in saang hlom khat a lak ih a hnim hnuah Simon Iskariot ih fapa Judas hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judas in cuih sang a lak vete in a sungah Satan a lut. Jesuh in a hnen ah, “Na tuah dingmi cu zamrangin tuah hmen!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cabuai kiangih a totu dang zokhal in ziang ruangah Judas hnenah cutiin a sim ti an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Judas cu tangka dip kengtu a si ruangah dungthluntu ṭhenkhat pawl cun Jesuh in puai hrangih a ṭulmi kha lei a fial a si hmang, a si lole mi farah hnenah ziang lo thil pek a fial a si hmang, tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judas in Jesuh pekmi sang cu a lak ih hmakhatte ah a suak. Cuih tikcu cu zan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judas a tlansuak hnuah Jesuh in, “Atu-ah Milai Fapa ih sunlawinak cu a lang zo; cule amah ih sungin Pathian sunlawinak khal a lang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cule a sungin Pathian sunlawinak langter a si ahcun Pathian in Milai Fapa ih sunlawinak cu amah sung rori in a langter ve ding. Cumi cu rei lote-ah a tuah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka faale pawl, nan hnenah reipi ka um nawn lo ding. Keimah hi in hawl ding; sikhalsehla Judah mi hotu pawl hnenih ka sim vekin nan hnen khalah ka sim: ‘Ka fehnak ah nan feh thei lo ding.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cule nan hnenah thukham thar ka lo pek: Pakhat le pakhat duhdaw aw uh! Keimah ih ka lo duhdawt vekin pakhat le pakhat nan duhdaw aw ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat tlunah duhdawtnak nan neih ahcun zokhal in keimah ih dungthluntu nan si kha an lo thei ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simon Piter in, “Bawipa, khui-ah so na feh ding?” tiah a sut. Jesuh in, “Ka fehnak ahcun i thlun thei hrih lo ding, asinain neh hnuah i thlun leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Piter in, “Bawipa, ziangah so atu-ah ka lo thlun thei lo? Na hrangah thih ka ngam a sisi!” tiah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka hrangah thih na ngam ngaingai maw? Thungaite in ka lo sim: ar a khuan hlanah anih ka thei lo, tiah voi thum tiang i phatsan ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Thinlung har le beidong in um hlah uh. Pathian zum uhla keimah khal i zum uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pa ih inn ah innkhaan tampi a um ih nan hrangih umnak rem dingah ka feh ding. Cutiin si hlah sehla hiti in ka lo sim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule ka feh ih nan umnak ka rem ngah hnuah ka ra sal ding ih ka hnenah ka lo hruai ding; cuticun ka umnak ah nan um ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka fehnak ding hmunih lamzin cu nan thei ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thomas in, “Bawipa, khuiah na feh ding ti kan thei lo; curuangah ziangtinso na fehnak lamzin cu kan theih ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Keimah cu lamzin le thutak le nunnak ka si. Keimah hnenin siarlo zohman ka Pa hnenah an thleng thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atu-ah cun zo ka si, ti in thei zo ih ka Pa khal nan thei ding; atu ihsin amah cu nan thei ih a hmuh khal nan hmu zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Filip in Jesuh hnenah, “Bawipa, na Pa cu in hmuh aw; cule kan lung a kim ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nan hnenah caan reipi ka um zo naón atu tiang in thei hrih lo maw, Filip? Zokhal keimah i hmutu cu ka Pa a hmu zo. Ziangtin so ‘Na Pa in hmuh aw,’ tiah i sut hrih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Filip, keimah hi ka Pa sungah ka um ih ka Pa khal ka sungah a um, tihi na zum lo maw? Nan hnenih ka ṭongmi hi keimah palung in a suakmi a si lo; ka sungih a ummi ka Pa ih hnaṭuannak in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keimah hi ka Pa sungah ka um ih ka Pa khal keimah ih sung ah a um, tiih ka timi hi zum uh. Cumi nan zum thei lo asile thil ka tuahmi ruang tal in zum uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: Keimah i zumtu cun ka tuahmi hi a tuah ve ding; a si, ka Pa hnenih ka feh ding ruangah hi hnakih thil mak sawn hman a tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule ka Pa ih sunlawinak cu Fapa sung ihsin a langnak dingah ka hmin in nan dilmi hmuahhmuah cu ka lo tuahsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hmin in nan dilmi pohpoh cu ka tuah ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Keimah in duhdawt ahcun ka thukham pawl nan thlun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pa hnenah ka dil ding ih nan hnenih kumkhua a um dingmi Bawmtu dang a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amah cu Pathian thutak a langtertu Thlarau a si. Leilung in Amah cu a hmu thei lo ih a theih thei fawn lo ruangah a pom thei lo. Sikhalsehla nannih cun nan thei, ziangahtile amah cu nan hnenah a um ih nan sungah a caam ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka feh tikah nanmahte lawngin ka lo tanta lo ding; nan hnenah ka ra sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A rei hlanah leilung mi cun in hmu thei nawn lo ding, sikhalsehla nannih cun in hmu ding; cule kei cu a nungmi ka si ruang ah nannih khal nan nung ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih ni a thlen tikah keimah nan sungih ka um vek hin ka Pa ih sungah ka um ti le nannih khal ka sungah nan um ve ti kha nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zokhal ka thukham pawl a pom ih a thluntu cu i duhdawtu a si. Keimah i duhdawtu poh cu ka Pa in a duhdawt ding; keimah khal in ka duhdawt ding ih a hnenah ka lang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judas Iskariot a si lomi Judas in, “Bawipa, ziangtinso leilung mi hnenah si loin kan hnen sawnah na lang awkter ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zokhal keimah i duhtu cun ka thu zirhmi a thlun ding. Ka Pa in a duhdawt ding ih ka Pa le keimah kan ra ding ih a hnenah kan um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keimah i duh lotu cun ka thuzirhmi khal a thlun lo. Cule ka thuzirhnak nan theihmi pawl hi keimah ih thusuak an si lo, i thlahtu ka Pa hnen ihsin a rami an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nan hnenih ka um laiah hi thu cu ka lo sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka hmin in ka Pa in a run thlah dingmi Bawmtu Thlarau Thianghlim in ziang hmuahhmuah a lo zirh ding ih ka lo sim ciami hmuahhmuah khal a lo cinkenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nan hnenah hnangamnak ka lo tanta. Keimah ih hnangamnak ka lo pek a si. Leilung mi ih pek vekin ka lo pe a si lo. Donhar le vansaang in um hlah uh; nan thin khal phang hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nan hnenah, ‘Ka feh ding, a si naón ka ra kir sal ding,’ tiih ka timi nan thei. In duh ngaingai a si ahcun Pa hnenih ka feh ding hi nan lung a awi ding; ziangahtile Amah cu keimah hnakin a tum sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka sim vekin a hung can ngaingai tikah nan zum theinak dingah atu a can hlan ihsin ka lo sim cia a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nan hnenah reipi thu ka sim thei nawn lo; ziangahtile hi leilung uktu pa a ra zo a si. Ka parah thuneihnak zianghman a nei lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />sikhalsehla ka Pa ka duhdawt kha leilung mi in an theih a ṭul; cutiih an theih theinak dingah Amah in thu i pekmi hmuahhmuah ka tuah ṭheh a si. Ra uh, hitawk hmun ihsin feh uhsi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Keimah cu sabit hri ngaingai ka si ih ka Pa cu hmuan neitu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sungih rah a rah lomi hnge tla cu a tan ṭheh ih a rahmi hnge kha a thiannak dingah le rah tam sinsin a rahnak dingah a hnge ṭha lo pawl kha a tansak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nannih tla cu thu ka lo zirhmi thawngin nan thiang zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keimah thawn pehzom uhla kei khal nanmah ka lo pehzom ve ding. sabit hnge cu amahte lawngin rah a rah thei dah lo; sabit hripi thawn a pehzom awk lawngah a rah thei a si. Cubangtuk in keimah thawn nan pehzom awk lo ahcun nan rah thei hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimah cu sabit hri ka si ih nannih cu a hnge nan si. Zokhal ka sungah a um ih kei khal a sungih ka umcilh mi cun rah tampi a rah ding; ziangahtile keimah tel lo cun zianghman nan tuah theimi a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zokhal keimah sungih a um lomi cu sabit hnge an hlon ih a carmi bangtuk a si ding. Cubangtuk hnge pawl cu an khawm ih meisa sungah an hlon ih a kang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keimah sungah nan um ih ka thu hi nan sungih a um ve ahcun nan duhmi pohpoh nan dil tikah nan ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rah tampi nan rahnak hin ka Pa ih sunlawinak nan langter ih cuti cun ka dungthluntu nan can theinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka Pa ih i duhdawt vekin nannih khal ka lo duhdawt ve; ka duhdawtnak sungah um ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka Pa ih thukham ka thlun ih cuti cun amah ih duhdawtnak sungih ka um vekin ka thukham nan thlun a si ahcun ka duhdawtnak sungah nan um ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lungawinak cu nan sungah a um ih nan lungawinak cu lungawi famkim a sinak dingah hi thu hi ka lo sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thukham cu hihi a si: Keimah ih ka lo duhdawt vek hin nannih khal pakhat le pakhat duhdaw aw ve uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi pakhat in a rualpi pawl hrangah duhdawtnak tum bik a neihmi cu an hrangih a nunnak pek hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule ka thupekmi nan tuah ahcun ka rualpi nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nannih tla cu hnen-um tiah ka lo ti nawn lo, ziangahtile hnen-um cun a bawipa ih tuahmi kha a thei lo. ‘Hnen-um,’ ti nawn loin ‘Rualpi,’ tiah ka lo ko: ziangahtile ka Pa hnen ihsin ka theihmi hmuahhmuah cu ka lo sim ṭheh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nannih in in hril lo; keimah in ka lo hril hai ih kumkhua ih a hmunmi rah nan va rah theinak dingah ka lo fial a si. Ka hmin in Pa hnenih nan dilmi hmuahhmuah cu a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule ka thupekmi cu hihi a si: pakhat le pakhat duhdaw aw uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nannih hi leilung in a lo hua a si ahcun keimah i hua hmaisa zo ti kha cing ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leilung ih ta si uh cila leilung hin ka ta tiah a lo duhzet hai ding. Sikhalsehla leilung ihsin ka lo hril zo ih a ta nan si nawn lo; curuangah leilung in a lo huatnak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Sal cu a bawipa hnakin a tum sawn lo,’ tiah ka lo timi kha cing ringring uh. Keimah in hrem ahcun nannih khal an lo hrem ve ding; ka thu an thlun ahcun nan thu an thlun ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu cu ka milai nan si ruangah hi thil hmuahhmuah hi nan parah an tuah ding. Ziangahtile keimah i thlahtu zo a si ti an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An hnenah ra loin le thusimnak nei loin um ningla an tlunah sualnak a um lo ding; asinain atu vek a si ahcun an sualnak ruangah puhmawh ding dang zianghman an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keimah i huatu cun ka Pa khal a hua ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An lakah zohmanih an tuah dah keel lomi thil pawl tuah loin um ningla an tlunah sualnak a um lo ding; sikhalsehla atu vek a si ahcun ka thil tuahmi an hmu ṭheh zo na cingin ka Pa thawn in hua a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi vekih a can a ṭul, ziangahtile an Daan cabu sungah ‘Ziang thuhla hman um loin in hua,’ tiah rak nganmi a um ih cumi a kimnak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka Pa hnen ihsin Bawmtu Thlarau a ra ding ih amah cu Pathian thutak langtertu a si ding. Ka Pa hnen ihsin ka run thlah ding ih keimah ih thuhla simtu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nannih khal a hramthok ihsin ka hnenih nan um zo ruangah ka thuhla nan sim ve ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nan zumnak ihsin nan tluksawn lonak dingah hi thu hi ka lo sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sinakok ihsin an lo dawi ding; zozo khal in nanmah thah hi Pathian hnaṭuan ih an ruah caan a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi in cuti vek cun nan parah an tuah ding, ziangahtile Pa an thei lo ih keimah khal in thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain atu ihsin ka lo sim cia, ziangahtile nan parih an tuah ngaingai tikah in rak sim cia zo ti kha nan thei ding. “Nan hnenih ka um ruangah a hramthok ihsin hi thu hi ka lo sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atu cu i thlahtu hnenah ka feh thlang ding; sikhalsehla zohman in khuiah na feh ding tiah in sut hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitiih ka lo sim hai ruangah nan thinlung cu riahsiatnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain thungaite in ka lo sim: ka feh ahcun nan hrangah a ṭha sawn, ziangahtile ka feh lo ahcun nan hnenah Bawmtu a ra lo ding. Asinain ka feh ahcun amah cu nan hnenah ka run thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule a rat tikah leilung mi pawl hnenah sualnak thu an ruahdan a palhzia, thudik an ruahdan a palhzia le Pathian thuṭhennak thu an ruahdan a palhzia pawl kha a langter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sualnak thu an ruahdan a palh, ziangahtile keimah in zum lo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thudik an ruahdan a palh, ziangahtile ka Pa hnenah ka feh ding ih in hmuh nawn lo ding ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun thuṭhennak thuhla khalah an ruahdan a palh, ziangahtile leilung uktu bawi hi thuṭhen cia zo a si ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nan hnenah sim ding tampi ka nei, asinain atu-ah cun nan ciing thei cawk lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Thlarau a run tikah cun Pathian thutak langtertu a si ruangah thutak hmuahhmuah ah a lo hruai ding. Ziangahtile amah ih thuthu in zianghman a ṭong lo ding; asinain a theihmi kha a sim ding ih a ra thleng leh dingmi thu tla kha a phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah in sunlawinak i pe ding, ziangahtile ka sim ciami kha a lak ding ih nan hnenah a phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka Pa ih neihmi hmuahhmuah cu ka ta a si, curuangah Thlarau in ka pekmi cu a la ding ih nan hnenah a phuang ding, tiah ka lo tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tikcu rei lote-ah in hmu nawn lo ding; cule caan malte hnuah in hmu sal ding,” tiah Jesuh in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A dungthluntu ṭhenkhat pawl cun, “Cumi cu a tican ziang a si pei? Tikcu rei lote-ah in hmu nawn lo ding; cule caan malte hnuah in hmu sal ding, tiah in ti. Cule ‘Pa hnenih ka feh ding ruangah,’ ti tla in a ti fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Rei lote-ah,’ timi hi ziang a ti duhnak a si pei? A sim duhmi hi kan thei thei hrimhrim lo!” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hnenah thusuh an duh kha Jesuh in a thei ih an hnenah, “Kei in ‘Tikcu rei lote-ah in hmu nawn lo ding; cule caan malte rei hnuah in hmu sal ding,’ ka ti ruangah maw nannih pakhat le pakhat thu nan sut awk rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: nannih cu nan ṭap nan ai ding naón leilung cu a lung a awi ding; nan riah a sia ding, asinain nan riahsiatnak cu lungawinak ah a cang leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nunau in nau a hrin zik tikah natnak a tuar, ziangahtile nauhrin nat a ra thleng zo; sikhalsehla naute a suak ngah tikah cun lei tlunah naute thar pakhat a suah ruangah a tuarnak hmuahhmuah cu a hngilh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cubangtuk in nannih tla nan si ve ding: atu-ah cun nan riah a sia, sikhalsehla ka lo hmu sal ding ih nan thinlung cu lungawinak in a khat ding; cuih lungawinak cu zohman in an lo lawng thei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih ni a thlen tikah cun zianghman in sut nawn lo ding. Thungai in ka lo sim: ka hmin in nan dilmi hmuahhmuah cu ka Pa in a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Atu tiangah ka hmin in zianghman nan dil dah lo. Dil uh nan ngah ding; cuticun nan lungawinak cu a kim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Atu tiang cu hi thu pawl ka sim tikah tahṭhimnak lawnglawng ka hmang. Sikhalsehla tahṭhimnak hmang nawn loin lailan in ka Pa ih thu ka simnak tikcu a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih ni a thlen tikah a hnenah ka hmin in nan dil ding; nanmah ih ai-ah ka lo dilsak ding tiah ka sim lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ziangahtile ka Pa amah rori in a lo duhdawt a si. Nannih in in duhdawt ih Pathian hnen ihsin ka rat kha nan zum zo ruangah ka Pa in a lo duhdawt a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pa hnen ihsin ka ra ih leilungah ka ra thleng. Atu cu leilung ka tlansan ding ih Pa hnenah ka feh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun a dungthluntu pawl in a hnenah, “Atu-ah cun tahṭhimnak telh loin lailante in in sim ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ziang hmuahhmuah theitu na si, ti kan thei zo; curuangah thu kan lo suh rero a ṭul nawn lo. Cumi in Pathian hnen ihsin a rami na si, ti kha in zumter zo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Atu-ah in zum ngaingai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nan zatein ṭhendarh ṭheh nan si ding ih nan inn ciarah nan tlung ding; keimahte lawng in taan tikcu a ra thleng ding; a si, atu a ra thleng zo. Sikhalsehla Pa ka hnenih a um ruangah keimah lawng ngaingai cu ka si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Keimah thawn nan pehzom awknak thawngin hnangamnak nan ngah theinak dingah hi thu hi ka lo sim. Leilung in harsat tuarnak a lo pe ding. Sikhalsehla nan ral ṭha uh; Leilung cu ka neh zo!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh in hi thu a sim ṭheh hnuah vanlam a zoh ih, “Ka Pa, a tikcu a ra thleng zo. Fapa in sunlawinak a lo pek theinak dingah na Fapa hnenah hin sunlawinak run pe hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fapa hnenih na pek zomi mi hmuahhmuah hnenih kumkhua nunnak a pek theinak dingah leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuahih tlunah thuneihnak na pek zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih kumkhua nunnak timi cu nangmah lawng Pathian taktak na sizia theih le na thlahmi Jesuh Khrih theih hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnaṭuan i pekmi ka ṭuan ṭheh zo ih na sunlawinak cu leilung ah ka langter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah maw ka Pa, leilung seemsuah a si hlanih nangmah thawn sunlawinak ka rak neihmi kha atu na mithmuh ah hin i pe hram aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Leilung ihsin na kawhsuakmi pawl hnenah na hmin cu ka langter zo. Cupawl cu na ta an si ih ka hnenah i pekmi an si. Na thu an thlun ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />atu cu ka hnenih i pekmi hmuahhmuah hi na hnen ihsin a rami an si ti tla an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I pekmi na thu kha ka sim hai ih annih in an pom zo. Na hnen ihsin a rami ka si ti thutak hi an thei taktak ih i thlahmi ka si ti khal hi an zum zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Anmah hrangah thla ka cam. Leilung hrangah thla ka cam lo, asinain i pekmi pawl hrangah ka cam; ziangahtile na ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka neihmi hmuahhmuah hi na ta an si ih na neihmi hmuahhmuah khal hi ka ta an si; cule an sung ihsin ka sunlawinak a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun atu-ah na hnenah ka ra ding; kei cu leilungah ka um nawn lo ding, asinain annih cu leilungah an um hrih ding. A Thiangmi ka Pa, nangmah le keimah cu pakhat kan si vekin leilungih a um hrihmi pawl cu pumkhat an si theinak dingah i pekmi na hminih huham in humhim hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An hnenih ka um laiah nangmah ih i pekmi na hminih huham in ka hum hai. Ca Thianghlim sungih a ummi a kimnak dingah a hloral ding a rak si ciami pakhat dah ti lo cu mi pakhat hman an hloral lo; ka humhim ṭheh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atu cu na hnenah ka ra thlang ding; leilung tlunah hi thu pawl ka simnak cu ka lungawinak kha an thinlung sungah famkim zetih an neih theinak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keimah cu hi leilungih ta ka si lo vek hin annih khal hi leilungih ta an si ve lo; curuangah na thu cu an hnenih ka sim tikah leilung in anmah a huatnak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anmah kha leilung ihsin lasuak aw tiah ka lo dil lo, asinain Miṭha lo pa ih hnen ihsin humhim hai aw tiah ka lo dil a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei cu leilungih ta ka si lo vekin annih khal leilungih ta an si ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Annih cu thutak in na ta siter hai aw; na ṭongkam cu thutak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei cu leilungah i thlah vekin annih khal ka thlah ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anmah tla thutak ih thianter an si theinak dingah keimah khal ka thiangter aw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Anmah hrang lawngah thla ka cam a si lo; an thusimmi a thei ih keimah i zumtu ding pawl hrang khalah thla ka cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An zatein pakhat an si theinak dingah thla ka cam. Ka Pa, nangmah cu ka sungah na um ih kei khal na sungih ka um vekin annih khal kan sungah um ve hram hai seh. Nangmah in i thlah hi leilung in an zum theinak dingah annih cu pakhat ah cang hram hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmah le keimah cu pakhat kan si vekin annih khal pakhat ih an can theinak dingah nangmah ih i pekmi sunlawinak kha anmah khal ka pek ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Annih pawl cu pakhat taktak an si ih cuticun leilung in nangmah ih thlahmi ka si ti a theihnak dingah le keimah i duhdawt vekin annih khal na duhdawt ti an theihnak dingah kei cu anmah ih sungah ka um ih nang cu ka sungah na um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ka Pa, nangmah ih i pekmi ka sunlawinak hi annih in an hmuh theinak dingah nangmah in annih cu ka kut sungah i pe zo. Anmah cu keimah ka umnak poh-ah um ve hai seh ti ka duh; ziangahtile leilung seemsuah hlan ihsin i duhdawt zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A dingmi ka Pa, nang cu leilung hin a lo thei lo, sikhalsehla kei cun ka lo thei ih annih in nangmah ih i thlah hi an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An hnenah na hmin cu ka phuang zo ih, ka parih duhdawtnak na neihmi hi an sungih a um venak dingah le keimah khal an sungih ka um venak dingah na hmin cu ka phuang vivo hrih ko ding,” tiah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hitiin Jesuh in thla a cam ṭheh hnuah dungthluntu pawl thawn an pok ih Kidron an timi tivate ral ah an feh. Cutawkah hmuan pakhat a um ih Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu cuih hmuan sungah an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih hmuan cu Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl an ton awk ṭheunak a si ruangah a zuartu Judas in khuitawkah a um ti a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah cuih hmuan ahcun Judas cu Rom ralkap bur khat, puithiam upa le Farasi pawl ih thlahmi Biakinn kiltu palik pawl thawn, hriamnam an keng ih mei-inn le meifar thawn an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesuh in a parah ziangbangtuk thil a ra thleng ding ti kha a theih ṭheh ruangah hmaiah a va suak ih, “Zoso nan hawl?” tiah a rak sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Annih in, “Nazareth mi Jesuh,” an ti. Jesuh in, “Keimah hi amah cu ka si,” a ti. A zuartu Judas cu an kiangah cun a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Keimah hi amah cu ka si,” a timi an theih tikah dunglamah ah siip ih leilungah an tlu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Zoso nan hawl?” tiah a sut lala. Annih in, “Nazareth mi Jesuh,” tiah an ti thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Keimah hi amah cu ka si, tiah ka lo sim zo. Keimah in hawl a si ahcun midang hi cu fehter uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hitiih a tinak cu, “Ka Pa, ka kut sungih i pekmi cu pakhat hman ka hlohtermi an um lo,” a timi kha kimternak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simon Piter in ralnam a kenmi cu a vun zuk ih Puithiam Saang salpa ih vorhlam hna a sat thlak. Cuih salpa ih hmin cu Malkhas a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh in Piter hnenah, “Na ralnam cu a kawm ah thun sal aw! Ka Pa ih i pekmi tuarnak hai hi ka in lo dingah maw si na ruat?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Rom ralkap cun an hotu ralbawi le Judah mi palik pawl thawn Jesuh cu an kai; an ṭem hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />hmaisabik ah Annas hnenah an fehpi. Annas cu cuih kumih Puithiam Saang a ṭuantu Kaiafas nupi ih pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaiafas cu mizapi ai-ah mi pakhat thih a ṭha sawn tiih Judah hotu pawl hnenih ruahnak petu kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simon Piter le a dang dungthluntu pakhat in Jesuh kha an thlun. Cuih dungthluntu cu Puithiam Saang thawn a thei aw zetmi an si ih Jesuh cu a thlun ih Puithiam Saang ih tual ah a vung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain Piter cu kotka lengah a rak um. Cule cuih dungthluntu cu a kir ih kotka kiltu nu cu a va biak hnuah Piter a run luhpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kotka kiltu nu in, “Khi pa a thluntu lakah na tel ve a si lo maw?” tiah Piter kha a ti. Piter in, “Ka si lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khua a sih ruangah hnen-um pawl le kiltu palik pawl in meihol in meipual an sep ih dinhmunin meisa an ai. Piter khal cu a va feh ve ih an hnenah dingin meisa a ai ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiam Saang in Jesuh cu a dungthluntu pawl ih thu le a thuzirhmi thu pawl a sut ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Langhnganin mizapi hnenah thu ka sim ringring. Mi tampi an ra khawmnak sinakok ah le Biakinnpi ah thu ka zirh ringring. A thup in ziang thu hman ka sim dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuti asinain ziangah so thu i sut? Ka thusimmi i theitu pawl kha sut sawn aw. Ka simmi an thei ṭheh ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutiih a ti tikah cutawkih a ummi palik pakhat in Jesuh kha a beng ih, “Puithiam Saang hnenah ziangtinso cutiin na ṭong ngam?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka ṭongsual mi a um ahcun cuih ka ṭong sualmi cu hitawk ih a ummi hmuahhmuah hnenah hin simhnik! Asinain ka ṭongmi hi a dikmi a si ahcun ziangah so i beng?” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutiin Annas in a ṭemnak phoih sak cuang loin Jesuh cu Puithiam Saang Kaiafas hnenah a kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Piter cu cutawkah meisa ai-in a ding lai. Culai ah midang pawl in, “Nang khal hi a dungthluntu lakah pakhat na si ve a si lo maw?” tiah an ti. Piter in, “Ka si lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Puithiam Saang hnen-um lakih pakhat, Piter in a hna a sahtan mi pa ih sungkhat pa in, “Hi Jesuh thawn hmuan sungah ka lo hmu a si lo maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain Piter cun, “Kei ka si lo,” a ti thotho. Cutikah ar a khuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zingpit ah Jesuh cu Kaiafas inn ihsin Mangki bawi innah an hruai. Judah mi hotu pawl cu an daan vekin thianghlimte ih Lantak Puai rawl ei an duh ruangah Mangki bawi inn sungah cun an lut lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Curuangah Pilat cu a va suak ih an hnenah, “Hi pa hi ziang sualnak so a neih?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Annih in, “Sualnak nei lo sisehla na hnenah hin kan rak hruai lo ding,” tiah an sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pilat in an hnenah, “Cuti asile nanmah in hruai uhla nanmah ih daan vekin a thu cu va rel uh,” tiah a ti. Annih in, “Kannih cun mithah theinak thu kan nei lo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesuh in ziangbangtuk thihnak so ka tuar ding ti ih a rak sim ciami ṭongkam kimnak dingah hi vekih a cannak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pilat cu a inn sungah a lut sal ih Jesuh cu a ko. “Judah Siangpahrang na si maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Hi thu i suhmi hi nangmah ih palung a si maw, midang in ka thu an lo sim ruangah so a si?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pilat in, “Judah mi ah maw si i ruat? Ka hnen a lo thlentu hi na miphun le puithiam upa pawl sokhaw an si! Na tuahmi thil cu ziangso a si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Kei ka uknak ram cu hi leilung tlunah a si lo; hi leilung tlunah sisehla Judah mi hotu pawl kut sungih thleng lo dingin ka dungthluntu pawl in an do ding. Ka uknak ram cu hi leilungah a si lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cutikah Pilat in, “Siangpahrang cu na si ngai maw?” tiah a sut. Jesuh in, “Nang cun Siangpahrang na si i ti. Leilung ih ka suahsanmi le ka ratsanmi cu thu pakhat lawng a si: cumi cu thutak sim ding hi a si. Thutak sungih a ummi hmuahhmuah cun ka thu simmi an ngai a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cutikah Pilat in, “Thutak cu ziang so a si?” tiah a sut. Cun Pilat cu misenpi hnenah a va suak sal ih an hnenah cun, “A parah mawhnak thu ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Curuangah daan nan neihmi vekin Lantak Puai ah thawngtla pakhatkhat ka lo thlah sak ṭheu. Judah siangpahrang hi lo thlah sak ningla nan duh maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Annih in, “Anih thlah kan duh lo! Barabbas thlah kan duh!” tiah an au ciamco. Barabbas cu suamhmang a rak si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule Pilat in Jesuh cu a hruai ih ralkap pawl a vuakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ralkap pawl in hling a neimi thinghnge in lukhuh an phiar ih an khumter. Cule puan sen an sinter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hnenah an feh ih, “Judah Siangpahrang hi a nunkhua sau hram seh,” tiah an ti ih an beng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pilat cu a va suak sal ih mipi hnenah, “Ngaihnik uh! A parah thah tlak sualnak ka hmu lo, ti langternak ah nan hnenah ka rak hruai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuti cun hling lukhuh khumin le puan sen sinin Jesuh cu a ra suak. Pilat in an hnenah, “Zoh uh! Mi pa cu hi pa hi a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puithiam upa pawl le Biakinn kiltu palik pawl in an hmuh tikah, “Thinglamtah ah that aw! Thinglamtah ah that aw,” tiah an auh. Pilat in an hnenah, “Nanmahte in hruai uhla thinglamtah ah va that uh! Kei cun a parah sualnak ka hmu lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Judah mi pawl cun, “Daan kan nei ih cuih daan vek cun a thih a ṭul a si, ziangahtile Pathian Fapa ka si a ti,” tiah an let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cumi cu Pilat in a theih tikah a thin a phang deuhdeuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A inn sungah a vung lut sal ih Jesuh cu, “Khuiinso na rat?” tiah a sut. Asinain Jesuh cun a sawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pilat in, “I sawn lo ding maw si? Nangmah thlah theinak le thah theinak thu ka neih hi na thei maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka tlunih thu na neih theinak hi Pathian ih a lo pek ruangah a si. Curuangah nang hnakin na kutih i thlengtertu pa hi a sual sawn a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cumi cu Pilat in a theih tikah Jesuh thlah theinak lamzin kha a hawl. Asinain mipi cun, “Hi pa na thlah asile Rom Siangpahrang ih rualpi na si lo. Zokhal Siangpahrang ka si a ti awtu cu Rom Siangpahrang ih ral an si,” tiah an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih ṭong cu Pilat in a theih tikah Jesuh cu lengah a hei suahpi ih, “Lungphah Tual,” timi hmunih thuṭhentu tonak ah a to. Cuih hmun cu Hebru ṭong in “Gabbatha,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lantak Puai ding ni khat a duh ni a si ih sunlai hrawng a si. Pilat in mipi pawl cu, “Nan Siangpahrang hi zohhnik uh!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Annih in, “That aw! That aw! Thinglamtah parah that aw!” tiah an au ciamco. Pilat in, “Nan Siangpahrang hi maw thinglamtah parah ka thah ding?” tiah a sut. Puithiam upa pawl in, “Sizar siarlo Siangpahrang dang kan nei lo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Pilat in Jesuh cu thah dingah an kut sungah a pek. Cutiin Jesuh cu an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thinglamtah pu in a suak ih “Luruh Hmun,” an timi hmunah a thleng. Cuih hmun cu Hebru ṭong in “Golgotha,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutawkah Jesuh cu thinglamtah ah an khen. A dang mipa pahnih tla an khen ve ih an karlak ah Jesuh cu an thlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pilat in ca a ngan ih thinglamtah parah a taarter. Cuih ca a nganmi cu, “Nazareth mi Jesuh, Judah Siangpahrang,” ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh an thlainak hmun cu khawpi ihsin a hlat lo ruangah cuih ca cu mi tampi in an siar. Hebru ṭong, Latin ṭong le Grik ṭong in nganmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Puithiam upa pawl in Pilat cu, “‘Judah Siangpahrang,’ ti si loin ‘Judah Siangpahrang ka si, a ti,’ tiah ngan aw,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilat in, “Ka ngan zomi cu ka ngan vekin um seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ralkap pawl in Jesuh cu thinglamtah parih an khen ṭheh hnuah a hnipuan cu an lak ih pakhat ciar co dingah ṭhen li ah an ṭhen. Cule zungṭhit nei lo ih tahmi a korfual khal cu an lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ralkap pawl cun, “Hi korfual cu kan thlek lo pei. Zo in a co ding ti theihnak ah camcawhfung kan zuk sawn pei,” tiah an ti. Hitiih thil a cannak cu Ca Thianghlim sungih, “Ka hnipuan cu an ṭhen aw ih, Ka kor hrangah camcawhfung an zuk,” timi a kimnak dingah a si. Cubangtuk cekci cun ralkap pawl in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh ih thinglamtah kiangah cun a nu le a nu ih naunu le Klopas nupi Mari le Mari Magdalene pawl an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesuh in a nu le a duhdawtmi dungthluntu pa cutawkih an din kha a hmu ih a nu hnenah cun, “Amah kha na fapa a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule a dungthluntu pa hnenah cun, “Anih kha na nu a si,” tiah a vun ti. Cuihsin thokin dungthluntu pa in Jesuh ih nu cu a innah a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesuh in ziang hmuahhmuah a kim ṭheh zo ti kha a thei; Ca Thianghlim sungih a ummi kimnak dingah, “Ka ti a haal,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutawkah sabitti thur beel khat a um ih cuih sabitti thur sungah puansia an hnim ih hissop fung zimah ṭemcih tahratin Jesuh cu a kaa-ah an hun hnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesuh in cuih sabitti thur cu a tep ih, “A kim ṭheh zo,” a ti. Cule a lu a kuun ih a thaw a cem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Judah mi hotu pawl cu Pilat hnenah an feh ih thinglamtah parih an thahmi pawl ih ke khiak dingah le an ruak pawl la dingah an va dil. An dil ni cu Tlawngkai Ninga a si, ziang ruangah an dil tile an thahmi ruak pawl cu Sabbath ni-ah thinglamtah parih an thlai awk hrih ding kha an duh lo; cuih Sabbath cu a thianghlim cemi ni a si fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Curuangah ralkap pawl an va feh ih Jesuh thawn hmunkhatih an thahmi pakhat pa ih ke an khiak ih cuih hnuah a pahnihnak pa ih ke khal an khiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh hnen an thlen tikah a thi ngah zo ti kha an hmu ih anih cu a ke an khiak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ralkap pakhat in Jesuh ih hnak kha a feipi in a hun sun ih hmakhatte ah thi le tidai a suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cuih thil a hmutu pa amah rori in a ṭongmi a si ih nan zum theinak dingah a si. A simmi hi a dikmi a si ih amah khal in thudik ka sim a si ti hi a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hitiih thil a cannak cu Ca Thianghlim sungah, “A ruh pakhatte hman an khiak lo ding,” tiih a ummi kha a kimnak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Ca Thianghlim hmun dangah, “An sunmi kha an zoh ding,” ti tla in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Arimathea khuami Josef in Jesuh ruak lak dingah Pilat hnenah a va dil. Josef cu Jesuh dungthluntu pakhat asinain Judah hotu pawl kha a ṭih ruangah a thupte in a rak thlun vivo. Pilat in Jesuh ruak kha na la thei, a ti ruangah Josef cun a va lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesuh tong dingah zanih a rak feh dahtu Nikodemas khal Josef hnenah a feh ve ih zihmui pawng zakhat tluk, mura zihmui le cing thling rawimi kha a keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />An pahnih in Jesuh ruak kha an lak ih Judah pawl ih mithi phum daan vekin zihmui thawn puanrang nemtein an tuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesuh an thahnak hmunah cun hmuan pakhat a um ih cuih hmuan sungah cun zohman an phum dah hrih lonak thlaan thar pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sabbath ni a si zik thlang ih cuih thlaan cu a naite fawn ruangah Jesuh ih ruak cu cutawkah an phum.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nipi Ni zingpit khua a van hlanah, Mari Magdalene cu thlaan ah a va feh ih thlaankhar lungpheng ṭhawn cia-in a um kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Simon Piter le Jesuh ih a duhdawtmi dungthluntu hnenah a va tlan ih, “Thlaan ihsin Bawipa an thiar hlo zo; khuitawkih an ret ti kan thei lo!” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Piter le a dang dungthluntu cu an pok ih thlaan ah an va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An pahnih in an tlan ih a dang dungthluntu cu Piter hnakin tlan a cak deuh ruangah hmaisa deuh ah thlaan ah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlaan sung cu a vun bih ih ruak tuamnak puan nemte cu a hmu, asinain a vung lut lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A dungin Simon Piter cu a ra thleng ih thlaan sung ahcun a vung lut mai. Ruak tuamnak puan nemte le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesuh ih lu ṭemnak puan kha a hmu. Asinain a lu ṭemnak puan cu ruak tuamnak puan nemte umnak ah a um lo; amah dangte in zual aw in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule dungthluntu dang, thlaan a thlengtu hmaisa deuhtu pa khal cu thlaan sungah cun a lut ve ih a hmu ih a zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thihnak ihsin a thosal ding tiih Ca Thianghlim ih a timi kha a tican an thei thiam hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule dungthluntu cu an inn ah an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mari cu thlaan lengah a ding ih a ṭap rero. Cutiih ṭah phah in a kuun ih thlaan sung cu a vun bih ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />vancungmi pahnih puanrang thawn thuam aw in Jesuh ruak an rak retnak ah khan a lu lamah pakhat, a ke lamah pakhat an to kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vancungmi cun, “Ziangah so na ṭah rero?” tiah Mari cu an sut. Anih in, “Ka Bawipa zo in si maw an lak ih khuitawkah an ret ti ka thei lo,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Mari cu a her ih cutawkih Jesuh a din kha a hmu; asinain Jesuh a si kha a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nunau nu, ziangah so na ṭah rero? Zoso na hawl?” tiah a sut. Cutiih a biatu cu hmuan kiltu a si tiin a ruat ih Mari cun, “Bawipa, nangmah in na lak a si ahcun na retnak kha i sim awla ka feh ding ih ka va la ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Mari!” tiah a vun ko. Mari cun Jesuh lam a hoi ih Hebru ṭong in “Rabboni!” tiah a ti. Rabboni ti cu Sayapa tican a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in Mari cu, “I kai hlah! Ziangahtile Pa hnenah ka thleng hrih lo. Asinain ka unau pawl hnenah va sim awla ‘An Pa a si vemi ka Pa, an Pathian a si vemi ka Pathian hnenah ka feh ding a ti,’ tiah va sim aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuti cun Mari Magdalene cu a feh ih Bawipa a hmuhnak thu le a hnenih a ṭongmi pawl hmuahhmuah cu dungthluntu pawl hnenah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih Nipi ni zanlam ah dungthluntu pawl cu hmunkhatah an tong aw. Judah mi hotu pawl an ṭih ruangah sangka hmuahhmuah an khar ṭheh. Cule Jesuh cu a ra lang ih anmah lakah a ding ih, “Nan hnenah daihnak um ko seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cumi a ṭong ṭheh in an hnenah a kut le a hnak a hmuh. Dungthluntu pawl cu an Bawipa an hmuh tikah an lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah cun, “Nan hnenah daihnak um ko seh! Ka Pa in i thlah vekin nannih khal ka lo thlah ve a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutiih a ṭong hnuah an parah a thaw a thawt ih, “Thlarau Thianghlim rak co uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi an sualnak nan ngaidam ahcun ngaidam an si ding; nan ngaidam lo a si ahcun ngaidam lo an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dungthluntu hleihnih lakah pakhat a si mi (Faphir an timi) Thomas cu Jesuh a lang laiah an hnenah a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Curuangah dungthluntu dang pawl in, “Bawipa kan hmu sokhaw!” tiah an sim. Thomas in an hnenah, “A kut thir in an khennak hma si ka hmuh ih ka kut in cuih hma si le a hnak kha ka tham ngah hlanah cun ka zum lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zarhkhat hnuah dungthluntu pawl cu innkhaan sungah an um ih Thomas khal a um ve. sangka an khar ṭheh naón Jesuh cu a ra lang ih an lakah a ding in, “Nan hnenah daihnak um ko seh!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Thomas hnenah cun, “Hinah na kutzung rak re hnik awla ka kut hi zohhnik aw; na kut rak dawh awla ka hnak hi tham aw. Zum loin um nawn hlah; zum thlang aw!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thomas in, “Ka Bawipa le ka Pathian!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesuh in, “I hmuh ruangah na zum a si maw? Keimah i hmu lo naón a zumtu cu mi thlawsuak an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dungthluntu pawl ih mit hmuhah Jesuh in hmuhsaknak tampi a tuahmi, hi cabu sungih ngan lomi tampi a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hi hmuah hi ka ngan ih ka ngannak sullam cu nannih in Jesuh cu Messiah, Pathian Fapa a si ti nan zum ih amah nan zumnak thawngin le amah ih hminin nunnak nan neihnak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jesuh cu a dungthluntu pawl hnenah Tiberias Tili ah a lang sal. A lang daan cu hiti in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Simon Piter, Faphir timi Thomas, Galilee peng Kana khuami Nathanael, Zebedi fapa pawl le Jesuh dungthluntu pahnih tla hmunkhat ah an tong khawm aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simon Piter in, “Kei cu sur ka vorh ding,” tiah a ti. Midang khal cun, “Kan ra tel ve ding,” an ti fingfing. Cutiin lawng pakhat in an feh; asinain cuih zan cu zianghman an kai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni a hung suah zawng ah Jesuh cu tikapte-ah a ding, asinain Jesuh a si ti kha dungthluntu pawl cun an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Naule uh, ziangtal nan kai lo maw?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Zianghman kan kai lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Nan lawng ih vorhlam kamah khan nan sur hei vorh uhla malte tal cu nan kai ding,” a ti. Cuti cun an sur cu an hei vorh ngaingai ih tamzet an awk ngah ruangah an sur hman cu an dir sal thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesuh ih a duhdawtmi dungthluntu cun Piter hnenah, “Bawipa sokhaw a si!” tiah a ti. Piter in Bawipa a si ti kha a theih tikah (a hnipuan a rak phoih cia ruangah) a kor lenghruk kha a hruk lohli ih ti sungah a dawp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dungthluntu dang pawl in nga a khatmi an sur cu an dir vivo ih tikap an thleng. Leilung ihsin a hla lem lo, pi zathum tluk lawng a rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tikap ih an hung kai tikah meiling parah nga le saang em ciami kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Jesuh in an hnenah, “Nan kaihmi nga cu rak keng uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Simon Piter cu lawng sungah a hung kai ih nga tumpipi a khatmi sur cu tikap ah a dirh. Nga cu pum za le sawmnga le pum thum a si; cutluk tam a si naón sur cu a tlek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesuh in an hnenah, “Ra uhla thawhhlam ra ei uh!” a ti. Dungthluntu lakah zohman in, “Zoso na si?” tiah an sut ngam lo; ziangahtile Bawipa a si ti an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesuh cu a va feh ih saang kha a lak ih a pek; nga khal a pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himi cu Jesuh thihnak ihsin a thawh hnuah dungthluntu hnenih a lang voithumnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An ei ṭheh hnuah Jesuh in Simon Piter cu, “Johan fapa Simon, hi midang pawl ih in duhdawt hnakin nang in i duhdaw sawn maw?” tiah a sut. Simon in, “A si Bawipa, ka lo duhdawt cu na thei,” tiah a ti. Jesuh in a hnenah, “Ka tuunote pawl kilkhawi aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A voihnihnak ah Jesuh in, “Johan fapa Simon, i duhdaw maw,” tiah a sut sal. Simon in, “A si Bawipa, ka lo duhdawt cu na thei,” tiah a let. Jesuh in, “Ka tuu pawl kilkhawi aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Johan fapa Simon, i duhdaw maw?” tiah voithumnak a sut lala. Cutiin voithum tiang Jesuh in, “I duhdaw maw?” tiih a sut ruangah Piter cu a riah a sia ih Jesuh hnenah cun, “Bawipa, nang cun ziang hmuahhmuah na thei ṭheh. Ka lo duhdawt ti khal na thei ṭheh ko a sisi!” tiah a ti. Cule Jesuh in, “Ka tuu pawl kilkhawi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thungaite in ka lo sim: na no laiah cun na tim na tuah ih na duhnak hmun poh ah na feh; asinain na tar tikah cun na ban na pharh ding ih midang in an lo ṭem ding ih na duh lonak hmunah an lo fehpi ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hitión a ṭong tikah Piter hi ziangbangtuk thihnak a tuar ding ih ziang bangtuk in Pathian hnenah sunlawinak a pe ding, ti kha Jesuh in a langternak a si. Cule Jesuh in, “I thlun aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Piter cu a her ih a dunglamah Jesuh ih a duhdawtmi dungthluntu kha a hmu. Hi dungthluntu pa cu rawl an ei laiah Jesuh a hei naih ih, “Bawipa, a lo zuartu ding cu zoso a si?” tiih a suttu kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Piter in cupa kha a hmuh tikah, “Bawipa, hi pa hi teh ziangti in so a si ding?” tiah Jesuh cu a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesuh in, “Ka rat tiang nung dingih ka duhmi a si ahcun na hrangah ziangso a poinak a um? I thlun sawn aw!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah hi dungthluntu cu a thi lo ding tiah Jesuh ih dungthluntu pawl lakah thu a thang. Sikhalsehla Jesuh in a thi lo ding, a timi a si lo: “Ka rat tiang nung dingih ka duhmi a si ahcun na hrangah ziangso a poinak a um?” a timi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi dungthluntu cu hi thu pawl a simtu le a ngantu khal a si; cule a simmi cu a dik a si ti kan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesuh ih a tuahmi thil dang tampi a um hrih. Pakhat hnu pakhat ngan vivo sehla nganmi cabu pawl cu leilung pumpi hmanah hin a tlem cawk lo ding tiah ka ruat.
  </para>
</usx>
